		Add(entries, 17, "Pidgeotto", "Bird", "This Pokémon flies around, patrolling its large territory. If its living space is violated, it shows no mercy in thoroughly punishing the foe with its sharp claws.", "Deserto de Calico, Fazenda & Arredores da Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, PokemonType.Flying, 1.1f, 30.0f);
		Add(entries, 18, "Pidgeot", "Bird", "This Pokémon has gorgeous, glossy feathers. Many Trainers are so captivated by the beautiful feathers on its head that they choose Pidgeot as their Pokémon.", "Fazenda, Vila Pelicanos & Floresta Cinzenta", "Primavera & Verão", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, PokemonType.Flying, 1.5f, 39.5f);
		Add(entries, 19, "Rattata", "Mouse", "A Rattata is cautious in the extreme. Even while it is asleep, it constantly moves its ears and listens for danger. It will make its nest anywhere.", "Montanha, Ponto de Ônibus & Ilha Gengibre", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, null, 0.3f, 3.5f);
		Add(entries, 20, "Raticate", "Mouse", "A Raticate's sturdy fangs grow steadily. To keep them ground down, it gnaws on rocks and logs. It may even chew on the walls of houses.", "Deserto de Calico, Fazenda & Arredores da Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, null, 0.7f, 18.5f);
		Add(entries, 21, "Spearow", "Tiny Bird", "Its loud cry can be heard over half a mile away. If its high, keening cry is heard echoing all around, it is a sign that they are warning each other of danger.", "Fazenda, Vila Pelicanos & Floresta Cinzenta", "Todas as Estações (Ano Inteiro)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, PokemonType.Flying, 0.3f, 2.0f);
