		Add(entries, 56, "Mankey", "Pig Monkey", "When it starts shaking and its nasal breathing turns rough, it's a sure sign of anger. However, since this happens instantly, there is no time to flee.", "Deserto de Calico, Fazenda & Arredores da Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Fighting, null, 0.5f, 28.0f);
		Add(entries, 57, "Primeape", "Pig Monkey", "When it becomes furious, its blood circulation becomes more robust, and its muscles are made stronger. But it also becomes much less intelligent.", "Fazenda, Vila Pelicanos & Floresta Cinzenta", "Todas as Estações (Ano Inteiro)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Fighting, null, 1.0f, 32.0f);
		Add(entries, 58, "Growlithe", "Puppy", "Its superb sense of smell ensures that this Pokémon won't forget any scent, no matter what. It uses its sense of smell to detect the emotions of others.", "Deserto de Calico & Encostas do Vulcão da Ilha", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Fire, null, 0.7f, 19.0f);
		Add(entries, 59, "Arcanine", "Legendary", "This fleet-footed Pokémon is said to run over 6,200 miles in a single day and night. The fire that blazes wildly within its body is its source of power.", "Caverna da Caveira & Forja do Vulcão", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Fire, null, 1.9f, 155.0f);
		Add(entries, 60, "Poliwag", "Tadpole", "It is possible to see this Pokémon's spiral innards right through its thin skin. However, the skin is also very flexible. Even sharp fangs bounce right off it.", "Praia dos Pelicanos, Oceano & Ilha Gengibre (Praia Tropical)", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, null, 0.6f, 12.4f);
		Add(entries, 61, "Poliwhirl", "Tadpole", "Its body surface is always wet and slick with an oily fluid. Because of this greasy covering, it can easily slip and slide out of the clutches of any enemy in battle.", "Rios da Floresta Cinzenta, Lago da Montanha & Ilha Tropical", "Todas as Estações (Ano Inteiro)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, null, 1.0f, 20.0f);
		Add(entries, 62, "Poliwrath", "Tadpole", "Its highly developed muscles never grow fatigued, however much it exercises. This Pokémon can swim back and forth across the Pacific Ocean without effort.", "Ilha Gengibre (Costa Sul & Rio Tropical) & Praia", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, PokemonType.Fighting, 1.3f, 54.0f);
		Add(entries, 63, "Abra", "Psi", "A Pokémon that sleeps 18 hours a day. Observation revealed that it uses Teleport to change its location once every hour.", "Ilha Gengibre (Ruínas Tropicais), Ferrovia & Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Psychic, null, 0.9f, 19.5f);
		Add(entries, 64, "Kadabra", "Psi", "It is rumored that a boy with psychic abilities suddenly transformed into Kadabra while he was assisting research into extrasensory powers.", "Montanha, Ferrovia, Torre do Mago & Deserto de Calico", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Psychic, null, 1.3f, 56.5f);
		Add(entries, 65, "Alakazam", "Psi", "While it has strong psychic abilities and high intelligence, an Alakazam's muscles are very weak. It uses psychic power to move its body.", "Ilha Gengibre (Ruínas Tropicais), Ferrovia & Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Psychic, null, 1.5f, 48.0f);
		Add(entries, 66, "Machop", "Superpower", "It continually undertakes strenuous training to master all forms of martial arts. Its strength lets it easily hoist a sumo wrestler onto its shoulders.", "Fazenda, Vila Pelicanos & Floresta Cinzenta", "Primavera & Verão", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Fighting, null, 0.8f, 19.5f);
		Add(entries, 67, "Machoke", "Superpower", "A belt is worn by a Machoke to keep its overwhelming power under control. Because it is so dangerous, no one has ever removed the belt.", "Montanha, Ponto de Ônibus & Ilha Gengibre", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Fighting, null, 1.5f, 70.5f);
		Add(entries, 68, "Machamp", "Superpower", "It is impossible to defend against punches and chops doled out by its four arms. Its fighting spirit flares up when it faces a tough opponent.", "Deserto de Calico, Fazenda & Arredores da Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Fighting, null, 1.6f, 130.0f);
		Add(entries, 69, "Bellsprout", "Flower", "A Bellsprout's thin and flexible body lets it bend and sway to avoid any attack, however strong it may be. From its mouth, it leaks a fluid that melts even iron.", "Esgotos dos Pelicanos, Covil dos Insetos & Bosque Secreto", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Grass, PokemonType.Poison, 0.7f, 4.0f);
		Add(entries, 70, "Weepinbell", "Flycatcher", "At night, a Weepinbell hangs on to a tree branch with its hooked rear and sleeps. If it moves around in its sleep, it may wake up to find itself on the ground.", "Minas Profundas (80-120), Caverna da Caveira & Cemitério", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Grass, PokemonType.Poison, 1.0f, 6.4f);
		Add(entries, 71, "Victreebel", "Flycatcher", "The long vine extending from its head is waved about as if it were a living thing to attract prey. When an unsuspecting victim approaches, it is swallowed whole.", "Bosque Secreto Noturno, Esgotos & Pantanal da Bruxa", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Grass, PokemonType.Poison, 1.7f, 15.5f);
		Add(entries, 72, "Tentacool", "Jellyfish", "Its body is almost entirely composed of water. It ensnares its foe with its two long tentacles, then stabs with the poison stingers at their tips.", "Praia dos Pelicanos, Oceano & Ilha Gengibre (Praia Tropical)", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, PokemonType.Poison, 0.9f, 45.5f);
		Add(entries, 73, "Tentacruel", "Jellyfish", "It lives in complex rock formations on the ocean floor and traps prey using its 80 tentacles. Its red orbs glow when it grows excited or agitated.", "Rios da Floresta Cinzenta, Lago da Montanha & Ilha Tropical", "Todas as Estações (Ano Inteiro)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, PokemonType.Poison, 1.6f, 55.0f);
		Add(entries, 74, "Geodude", "Rock", "It climbs mountain paths using only the power of its arms. Because they look just like boulders lining paths, hikers may step on them without noticing.", "Caverna da Caveira, Deserto de Calico & Vulcão", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Rock, PokemonType.Ground, 0.4f, 20.0f);
		Add(entries, 75, "Graveler", "Rock", "They descend from mountains by tumbling down steep slopes. They are so brutal, they smash aside obstructing trees and massive boulders with thunderous tackles.", "Deserto de Calico, Pedreira & Caverna da Caveira", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Rock, PokemonType.Ground, 1.0f, 105.0f);
		Add(entries, 76, "Golem", "Megaton", "It is said to live in volcanic craters on mountain peaks. Once a year, it sheds its hide and grows larger. The shed hide crumbles and returns to the soil.", "Minas da Montanha (1-39), Pedreira & Deserto", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Rock, PokemonType.Ground, 1.4f, 300.0f);
		Add(entries, 77, "Ponyta", "Fire Horse", "A Ponyta is very weak at birth. It can barely stand up. Its legs become stronger as it stumbles and falls while trying to keep up with its parent.", "Caverna da Caveira & Forja do Vulcão", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Fire, null, 1.0f, 30.0f);
		Add(entries, 78, "Rapidash", "Fire Horse", "It usually canters casually in the fields and plains. But once a Rapidash turns serious, its fiery manes flare and blaze as it gallops its way up to 150 mph.", "Vulcão da Ilha Gengibre & Minas de Lava (80-120)", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Fire, null, 1.7f, 95.0f);
		Add(entries, 79, "Slowpoke", "Dopey", "It catches prey by dipping its tail in water at the side of a river. But it often forgets what it is doing and spends entire days just loafing at water's edge.", "Rios da Floresta Cinzenta, Lago da Montanha & Ilha Tropical", "Outono & Inverno", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, PokemonType.Psychic, 1.2f, 36.0f);
		Add(entries, 80, "Slowbro", "Hermit Crab", "Its tail has a Shellder firmly attached with a bite. As a result, the tail can't be used for fishing anymore. This forces it to reluctantly swim and catch prey.", "Ilha Gengibre (Costa Sul & Rio Tropical) & Praia", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, PokemonType.Psychic, 1.6f, 78.5f);
		Add(entries, 81, "Magnemite", "Magnet", "The units at its sides are extremely powerful magnets. They generate enough magnetism to draw in iron objects from over 300 feet away.", "Deserto de Calico, Pedreira & Caverna da Caveira", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Tempestade de Raios ou Chuva", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Electric, PokemonType.Steel, 0.3f, 6.0f);
		Add(entries, 82, "Magneton", "Magnet", "It is actually three Magnemite linked by magnetism. It generates powerful radio waves that raise temperatures by 3.6 degrees F within a 3,300-foot radius.", "Minas da Montanha (1-39), Pedreira & Deserto", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Tempestade de Raios ou Chuva", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Electric, PokemonType.Steel, 1.0f, 60.0f);
		Add(entries, 83, "Farfetch'd", "Wild Duck", "It is always seen with a stick from a plant. Apparently, there are good sticks and bad sticks. This Pokémon occasionally fights with others over choice sticks.", "Deserto de Calico, Fazenda & Arredores da Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, PokemonType.Flying, 0.8f, 15.0f);
		Add(entries, 84, "Doduo", "Twin Bird", "Even while eating or sleeping, one of the heads remains always vigilant for any sign of danger. When threatened, it flees at over 60 miles per hour.", "Fazenda, Vila Pelicanos & Floresta Cinzenta", "Primavera, Verão & Outono", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, PokemonType.Flying, 1.4f, 39.2f);
		Add(entries, 85, "Dodrio", "Triple Bird", "A peculiar Pokémon species with three heads. It vigorously races across grassy plains even in arid seasons with little rainfall.", "Montanha, Ponto de Ônibus & Ilha Gengibre", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, PokemonType.Flying, 1.8f, 85.2f);
		Add(entries, 86, "Seel", "Sea Lion", "Seel hunt for prey in frigid, ice-covered seas. When it needs to breathe, it punches a hole through the ice with the sharply protruding section of its head.", "Ilha Gengibre (Costa Sul & Rio Tropical) & Praia", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, null, 1.1f, 90.0f);
		Add(entries, 87, "Dewgong", "Sea Lion", "It loves to snooze on bitterly cold ice. The sight of this Pokémon sleeping on a glacier was mistakenly thought to be a mermaid by a mariner long ago.", "Pico da Montanha, Ferrovia & Floresta no Inverno", "Inverno (Qualquer estação nas Minas 40-79)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, PokemonType.Ice, 1.7f, 120.0f);
		Add(entries, 88, "Grimer", "Sludge", "Born from polluted sludge in the sea, Grimer's favorite food is anything filthy. They feed on wastewater pumped out from factories.", "Minas Profundas (80-120), Caverna da Caveira & Cemitério", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Poison, null, 0.9f, 30.0f);
		Add(entries, 89, "Muk", "Sludge", "It prefers warm and humid habitats. In the summertime, the toxic substances in its body intensify, making Muk reek like putrid kitchen garbage.", "Bosque Secreto Noturno, Esgotos & Pantanal da Bruxa", "Todas as Estações (Ano Inteiro)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Poison, null, 1.2f, 30.0f);
		Add(entries, 90, "Shellder", "Bivalve", "At night, it burrows a hole in the seafloor with its broad tongue to make a place to sleep. While asleep, it closes its shell, but leaves its tongue hanging out.", "Praia dos Pelicanos, Oceano & Ilha Gengibre (Praia Tropical)", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, null, 0.3f, 4.0f);
		Add(entries, 91, "Cloyster", "Bivalve", "It swims in the sea by swallowing water, then jetting it out toward the rear. The Cloyster shoots spikes from its shell using the same system.", "Pico da Montanha, Ferrovia & Floresta no Inverno", "Inverno (Qualquer estação nas Minas 40-79)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, PokemonType.Ice, 1.5f, 132.5f);
		Add(entries, 92, "Gastly", "Gas", "When exposed to a strong wind, a Gastly's gaseous body quickly dwindles away. They cluster under the eaves of houses to escape the ravages of wind.", "Bosque Secreto Noturno, Esgotos & Pantanal da Bruxa", "Primavera, Verão & Outono", "Noite Nebulosa, Chuva ou Céu Limpo", "Noturno (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Ghost, PokemonType.Poison, 1.3f, 0.1f);
		Add(entries, 93, "Haunter", "Gas", "If a Haunter beckons you while it is floating in darkness, don't approach it. This Pokémon will try to lick you with its tongue and steal your life away.", "Esgotos dos Pelicanos, Covil dos Insetos & Bosque Secreto", "Todas as Estações (Ano Inteiro)", "Noite Nebulosa, Chuva ou Céu Limpo", "Noturno (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Ghost, PokemonType.Poison, 1.6f, 0.1f);
		Add(entries, 94, "Gengar", "Shadow", "Deep in the night, your shadow cast by a streetlight may suddenly overtake you. It is actually a Gengar running past you, pretending to be your shadow.", "Minas Profundas (80-120), Caverna da Caveira & Cemitério", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Noite Nebulosa, Chuva ou Céu Limpo", "Noturno (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Ghost, PokemonType.Poison, 1.5f, 40.5f);
		Add(entries, 95, "Onix", "Rock Snake", "There is a magnet in its brain that prevents an Onix from losing direction while tunneling. As it grows older, its body becomes steadily rounder and smoother.", "Caverna da Caveira, Deserto de Calico & Vulcão", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Rock, PokemonType.Ground, 8.8f, 210.0f);
		Add(entries, 96, "Drowzee", "Hypnosis", "If your nose becomes itchy while you are sleeping, it's a sure sign that a Drowzee is standing above your pillow and trying to eat your dream through your nostrils.", "Montanha, Ferrovia, Torre do Mago & Deserto de Calico", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Psychic, null, 1.0f, 32.4f);
		Add(entries, 97, "Hypno", "Hypnosis", "The arcing movement and glitter of the pendulum in a Hypno's hand lull the foe into deep hypnosis. While searching for prey, it polishes the pendulum.", "Ilha Gengibre (Ruínas Tropicais), Ferrovia & Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Psychic, null, 1.6f, 75.6f);
		Add(entries, 98, "Krabby", "River Crab", "Krabby live in holes dug into beaches. On sandy shores with little in the way of food, they can be seen squabbling with each other over territory.", "Ilha Gengibre (Costa Sul & Rio Tropical) & Praia", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, null, 0.4f, 6.5f);
		Add(entries, 99, "Kingler", "Pincer", "It waves its huge, oversized claw in the air to communicate with others. But since the claw is so heavy, this Pokémon quickly tires.", "Praia dos Pelicanos, Oceano & Ilha Gengibre (Praia Tropical)", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, null, 1.3f, 60.0f);
		Add(entries, 100, "Voltorb", "Ball", "It bears an uncanny and unexplained resemblance to a Poké Ball. Because it explodes at the slightest shock, even veteran Trainers treat it with caution.", "Montanha, Ferrovia, Torre do Mago & Deserto de Calico", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Tempestade de Raios ou Chuva", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Electric, null, 0.5f, 10.4f);
		Add(entries, 101, "Electrode", "Ball", "They appear in great numbers at electric power plants. Because they feed on electricity, they cause massive and chaotic blackouts in nearby cities.", "Ilha Gengibre (Ruínas Tropicais), Ferrovia & Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Tempestade de Raios ou Chuva", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Electric, null, 1.2f, 66.6f);
		Add(entries, 102, "Exeggcute", "Egg", "It consists of six eggs that care for each other. The eggs attract each other and spin around. When cracks increasingly appear, it is close to evolution.", "Floresta Cinzenta, Bosque Secreto & Fazenda", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Grass, PokemonType.Psychic, 0.4f, 2.5f);
		Add(entries, 103, "Exeggutor", "Coconut", "Originally from the tropics, Exeggutor's heads grow larger from exposure to strong sunlight. It is said that when the heads fall, they group to form an Exeggcute.", "Ilha Gengibre (Selva Tropical) & Bosque Secreto", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Grass, PokemonType.Psychic, 2.0f, 120.0f);
		Add(entries, 104, "Cubone", "Lonely", "It pines for the mother it will never see again. Seeing a likeness of its mother in the full moon, it cries. The stains on the skull it wears are from its tears.", "Caverna da Caveira, Deserto de Calico & Vulcão", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Ground, null, 0.4f, 6.5f);
		Add(entries, 105, "Marowak", "Bone Keeper", "A Marowak is the evolved form of a Cubone that has grown tough by overcoming the grief of losing its mother. Its tempered and hardened spirit is not easily broken.", "Deserto de Calico, Pedreira & Caverna da Caveira", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Ground, null, 1.0f, 45.0f);
		Add(entries, 106, "Hitmonlee", "Kicking", "Its legs freely stretch and contract. Using these springlike limbs, it bowls over foes with devastating kicks. After battle, it rubs down its tired legs.", "Montanha, Ponto de Ônibus & Ilha Gengibre", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Fighting, null, 1.5f, 49.8f);
		Add(entries, 107, "Hitmonchan", "Punching", "A Hitmonchan is said to possess the spirit of a boxer who aimed to become the world champion. Having an indomitable spirit means that it will never give up.", "Deserto de Calico, Fazenda & Arredores da Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Fighting, null, 1.4f, 50.2f);
		Add(entries, 108, "Lickitung", "Licking", "Whenever it sees something unfamiliar, it always licks the object because it memorizes things by texture and taste. It is somewhat put off by sour things.", "Fazenda, Vila Pelicanos & Floresta Cinzenta", "Primavera, Verão & Outono", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, null, 1.2f, 65.5f);
		Add(entries, 109, "Koffing", "Poison Gas", "Getting up close to a Koffing will give you a chance to observe, through its thin skin, the toxic gases swirling inside. It blows up at the slightest stimulation.", "Minas Profundas (80-120), Caverna da Caveira & Cemitério", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Poison, null, 0.6f, 1.0f);
		Add(entries, 110, "Weezing", "Poison Gas", "By diluting its toxic gases with a special process, the highest grade of perfume can be extracted. To Weezing, gases emanating from garbage are the ultimate feast.", "Bosque Secreto Noturno, Esgotos & Pantanal da Bruxa", "Primavera & Verão", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Poison, null, 1.2f, 9.5f);
		Add(entries, 111, "Rhyhorn", "Spikes", "Once it starts running, it doesn't stop. Its tiny brain makes it so stupid that it can't remember why it started running in the first place.", "Deserto de Calico, Pedreira & Caverna da Caveira", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Ground, PokemonType.Rock, 1.0f, 115.0f);
		Add(entries, 112, "Rhydon", "Drill", "Its horn, which rotates like a drill, destroys tall buildings with one strike. It stands on its hind legs, and its brain is well developed.", "Minas da Montanha (1-39), Pedreira & Deserto", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Ground, PokemonType.Rock, 1.9f, 120.0f);
		Add(entries, 113, "Chansey", "Egg", "Chansey lay nutritionally excellent eggs every day. The eggs are so delicious, they are eagerly devoured by even those people who have lost their appetite.", "Deserto de Calico, Fazenda & Arredores da Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, null, 1.1f, 34.6f);
		Add(entries, 114, "Tangela", "Vine", "Its vines snap off easily and painlessly if they are grabbed, allowing it to make a quick getaway. The lost vines are replaced by new growth the very next day.", "Floresta Cinzenta, Bosque Secreto & Fazenda", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Grass, null, 1.0f, 35.0f);
		Add(entries, 115, "Kangaskhan", "Parent", "If you come across a young Kangaskhan playing by itself, never try to catch it. The baby's parent is sure to be in the area, and it will become violently enraged.", "Montanha, Ponto de Ônibus & Ilha Gengibre", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, null, 2.2f, 80.0f);
		Add(entries, 116, "Horsea", "Dragon", "By cleverly flicking the fins on its back side to side, it moves in any direction while facing forward. It spits ink to escape if it senses danger.", "Ilha Gengibre (Costa Sul & Rio Tropical) & Praia", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, null, 0.4f, 8.0f);
		Add(entries, 117, "Seadra", "Dragon", "The poisonous barbs all over its body are highly valued as ingredients for making traditional herbal medicine. It shows no mercy to anything approaching its nest.", "Praia dos Pelicanos, Oceano & Ilha Gengibre (Praia Tropical)", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, null, 1.2f, 25.0f);
		Add(entries, 118, "Goldeen", "Goldfish", "In the springtime, schools of Goldeen can be seen swimming up falls and rivers. It metes out staggering damage with its single horn.", "Rios da Floresta Cinzenta, Lago da Montanha & Ilha Tropical", "Primavera & Verão", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, null, 0.6f, 15.0f);
		Add(entries, 119, "Seaking", "Goldfish", "It punches holes in boulders on stream- beds. This is a clever innovation that prevents its eggs from being attacked or washed away by the current.", "Ilha Gengibre (Costa Sul & Rio Tropical) & Praia", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, null, 1.3f, 39.0f);
		Add(entries, 120, "Staryu", "Star Shape", "It gathers with others in the night and makes its red core glow on and off with the twinkling stars. It can regenerate limbs if they are severed from its body.", "Praia dos Pelicanos, Oceano & Ilha Gengibre (Praia Tropical)", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, null, 0.8f, 34.5f);
		Add(entries, 121, "Starmie", "Mysterious", "People in ancient times imagined that Starmie were transformed from the reflections of stars that twinkled on gentle waves at night.", "Rios da Floresta Cinzenta, Lago da Montanha & Ilha Tropical", "Todas as Estações (Ano Inteiro)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, PokemonType.Psychic, 1.1f, 80.0f);
		Add(entries, 122, "Mr. Mime", "Barrier", "A Mr. Mime is a master of pantomime. It can convince others that something unseeable actually exists. Once believed, the imaginary object does become real.", "Arredores da Vila Pelicanos, Fazenda & Floresta", "Primavera & Verão", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Psychic, PokemonType.Fairy, 1.3f, 54.5f);
		Add(entries, 123, "Scyther", "Mantis", "Its blindingly fast speed adds to the sharpness of its twin forearm scythes. The scythes can slice through thick logs in one wicked stroke.", "Floresta Cinzenta, Bosque Secreto & Fazenda", "Outono & Inverno", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Bug, PokemonType.Flying, 1.5f, 56.0f);
		Add(entries, 124, "Jynx", "Human Shape", "A Jynx sashays rhythmically as if it were dancing. Its motions are so bouncingly alluring, people seeing it are compelled to shake their hips without noticing.", "Minas Congeladas (Andares 40-79) & Montanha no Inverno", "Inverno (Qualquer estação nas Minas 40-79)", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Ice, PokemonType.Psychic, 1.4f, 40.6f);
		Add(entries, 125, "Electabuzz", "Electric", "When a storm approaches, it competes with others to scale heights that are likely to be stricken by lightning. Some towns use Electabuzz in place of lightning rods.", "Ilha Gengibre (Ruínas Tropicais), Ferrovia & Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Tempestade de Raios ou Chuva", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Electric, null, 1.1f, 30.0f);
		Add(entries, 126, "Magmar", "Spitfire", "In battle, it blows out intense flames from all over its body to intimidate its foe. These fiery bursts create heat waves that ignite grass and trees in the area.", "Vulcão da Ilha Gengibre & Minas de Lava (80-120)", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Fire, null, 1.3f, 44.5f);
		Add(entries, 127, "Pinsir", "Stag Beetle", "Their pincers are strong enough to shatter thick logs. Because they dislike cold, Pinsir burrow and sleep under the ground on chilly nights.", "Ilha Gengibre (Selva Tropical) & Bosque Secreto", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Bug, null, 1.5f, 55.0f);
		Add(entries, 128, "Tauros", "Wild Bull", "It is not satisfied unless it is rampaging at all times. If there is no opponent for Tauros to battle, it will charge at thick trees and knock them down to calm itself.", "Deserto de Calico, Fazenda & Arredores da Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, null, 1.4f, 88.4f);
		Add(entries, 129, "Magikarp", "Fish", "Its swimming muscles are weak, so it is easily washed away by currents. In places where water pools, you can see many Magikarp deposited there by the flow.", "Praia dos Pelicanos, Oceano & Ilha Gengibre (Praia Tropical)", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, null, 0.9f, 10.0f);
		Add(entries, 130, "Gyarados", "Atrocious", "It is an extremely vicious and violent Pokémon. When humans begin to fight, it will appear and burn everything to the ground with intensely hot flames.", "Rios da Floresta Cinzenta, Lago da Montanha & Ilha Tropical", "Primavera & Verão", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, PokemonType.Flying, 6.5f, 235.0f);
		Add(entries, 131, "Lapras", "Transport", "People have driven Lapras almost to the point of extinction. In the evenings, it is said to sing plaintively as it seeks what few others of its kind still remain.", "Pico da Montanha, Ferrovia & Floresta no Inverno", "Inverno (Qualquer estação nas Minas 40-79)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, PokemonType.Ice, 2.5f, 220.0f);
		Add(entries, 132, "Ditto", "Transform", "A Ditto rearranges its cell structure to transform itself. However, if it tries to change based on its memory, it will get details wrong.", "Fazenda, Vila Pelicanos & Floresta Cinzenta", "Primavera, Verão & Outono", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, null, 0.3f, 4.0f);
		Add(entries, 133, "Eevee", "Evolution", "Eevee habita os ecossistemas naturais da região e possui habilidades únicas.", "Montanha, Ponto de Ônibus & Ilha Gengibre", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Starter", PokemonType.Normal, null, 0.3f, 6.5f);
		Add(entries, 134, "Vaporeon", "Bubble Jet", "Vaporeon underwent a spontaneous mutation and grew fins and gills that allow them to live underwater. They have the ability to freely control water.", "Ilha Gengibre (Costa Sul & Rio Tropical) & Praia", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, null, 1.0f, 29.0f);
		Add(entries, 135, "Jolteon", "Lightning", "Its cells generate weak power that is amplified by its fur's static electricity to drop thunderbolts. The bristling fur is made of electrically charged needles.", "Ilha Gengibre (Ruínas Tropicais), Ferrovia & Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Tempestade de Raios ou Chuva", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Electric, null, 0.8f, 24.5f);
		Add(entries, 136, "Flareon", "Flame", "Flareon's fluffy fur releases heat into the air so that its body does not get excessively hot. Its body temperature can rise to a maximum of 1,650 degrees F.", "Deserto de Calico & Encostas do Vulcão da Ilha", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Fire, null, 0.9f, 25.0f);
		Add(entries, 137, "Porygon", "Virtual", "It is capable of reverting itself entirely back to program data in order to enter cyberspace. A Porygon is copy- protected so it cannot be duplicated.", "Deserto de Calico, Fazenda & Arredores da Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, null, 0.8f, 36.5f);
		Add(entries, 138, "Omanyte", "Spiral", "One of the ancient and long-since-extinct Pokémon that have been regenerated from fossils by humans. If attacked, it withdraws into its hard shell.", "Deserto de Calico, Pedreira & Caverna da Caveira", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Rock, PokemonType.Water, 0.4f, 7.5f);
		Add(entries, 139, "Omastar", "Spiral", "An Omastar uses its tentacles to capture its prey. It is believed to have become extinct because its shell grew too large, making its movements slow and ponderous.", "Minas da Montanha (1-39), Pedreira & Deserto", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Rock, PokemonType.Water, 1.0f, 35.0f);
		Add(entries, 140, "Kabuto", "Shellfish", "It is a Pokémon that has been regenerated from a fossil. However, in rare cases, living examples have been discovered. Kabuto have not changed for 300 million years.", "Caverna da Caveira, Deserto de Calico & Vulcão", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Rock, PokemonType.Water, 0.5f, 11.5f);
		Add(entries, 141, "Kabutops", "Shellfish", "Kabutops once swam underwater to hunt for prey. It was apparently evolving from being a water dweller to living on land as evident from changes in its gills and legs.", "Deserto de Calico, Pedreira & Caverna da Caveira", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Rock, PokemonType.Water, 1.3f, 40.5f);
		Add(entries, 142, "Aerodactyl", "Fossil", "Aerodactyl is a Pokémon from the age of dinosaurs. It was regenerated from DNA extracted from amber. It is imagined to have been the king of the skies.", "Minas da Montanha (1-39), Pedreira & Deserto", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Rock, PokemonType.Flying, 1.8f, 59.0f);
		Add(entries, 143, "Snorlax", "Sleeping", "Snorlax's typical day consists of nothing more than eating and sleeping. It is such a docile Pokémon that there are children who use its big belly as a place to play.", "Deserto de Calico, Fazenda & Arredores da Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, null, 2.1f, 460.0f);
		Add(entries, 144, "Articuno", "Freeze", "Articuno is a legendary bird Pokémon that can control ice. The flapping of its wings chills the air. As a result, it is said that when this Pokémon flies, snow will fall.", "Ilha Gengibre (Recife Oeste) & Profundezas Oceânicas", "Inverno (Qualquer estação nas Minas 40-79)", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Crepúsculo & Noite Profunda (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Legendary", PokemonType.Ice, PokemonType.Flying, 1.7f, 55.4f);
		Add(entries, 145, "Zapdos", "Electric", "Zapdos is a legendary bird Pokémon that has the ability to control electricity. It usually lives in thunderclouds. It gains power if it is stricken by lightning bolts.", "Cume do Vale (The Summit), Caverna da Caveira & Vulcão", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Tempestade de Raios ou Chuva", "Amanhecer Dourado (06:00h às 10:00h)", "Legendary", PokemonType.Electric, PokemonType.Flying, 1.6f, 52.6f);
		Add(entries, 146, "Moltres", "Flame", "Moltres is a legendary bird Pokémon that can control fire. If injured, it is said to dip its body in the molten magma of a volcano to burn and heal itself.", "Vulcão da Ilha Gengibre (Caldeira) & Caverna da Caveira", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Meia-Noite (22:00h às 02:00h)", "Legendary", PokemonType.Fire, PokemonType.Flying, 2.0f, 60.0f);
		Add(entries, 147, "Dratini", "Dragon", "A Dratini continually molts and sloughs off its old skin. It does so because the life energy within its body steadily builds to reach uncontrollable levels.", "Ilha Gengibre (Cratera do Vulcão) & Caverna dos Piratas", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Dragon, null, 1.8f, 3.3f);
		Add(entries, 148, "Dragonair", "Dragon", "A Dragonair stores an enormous amount of energy inside its body. It is said to alter the weather around it by loosing energy from the crystals on its neck and tail.", "Caverna da Caveira, Vulcão da Ilha & Cume da Montanha", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Dragon, null, 4.0f, 16.5f);
		Add(entries, 149, "Dragonite", "Dragon", "It can circle the globe in just 16 hours. It is a kindhearted Pokémon that leads lost and foundering ships in a storm to the safety of land.", "Ilha Gengibre (Cratera do Vulcão) & Caverna dos Piratas", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Dragon, PokemonType.Flying, 2.2f, 210.0f);
		Add(entries, 150, "Mewtwo", "Genetic", "A Pokémon that was created by genetic manipulation. However, even though the scientific power of humans made its body, they failed to give it a warm heart.", "Bosque Secreto, Santuário da Ilha & Cume do Vale", "Primavera & Verão", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Crepúsculo & Noite Profunda (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Legendary", PokemonType.Psychic, null, 2.0f, 122.0f);
		Add(entries, 151, "Mew", "New Species", "A Mew is said to possess the genes of all Pokémon. It is capable of making itself invisible at will, so it entirely avoids notice even if it approaches people.", "Bosque Secreto, Santuário da Ilha & Cume do Vale", "Outono & Inverno", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Amanhecer Dourado (06:00h às 10:00h)", "Mythical", PokemonType.Psychic, null, 0.4f, 4.0f);
		Add(entries, 152, "Chikorita", "Leaf", "It waves its leaf around to keep foes at bay. However, a sweet fragrance also wafts from the leaf, creating a friendly atmosphere that becalms the battlers.", "Arredores da Vila Pelicanos, Fazenda & Floresta", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Starter", PokemonType.Grass, null, 0.9f, 6.4f);
		Add(entries, 153, "Bayleef", "Leaf", "A Bayleef's neck is ringed by curled-up leaves. Inside each leaf is a small tree shoot. The fragrance of this shoot makes people peppy.", "Floresta Cinzenta, Bosque Secreto & Fazenda", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Starter", PokemonType.Grass, null, 1.2f, 15.8f);
		Add(entries, 154, "Meganium", "Herb", "The fragrance of a Meganium's flower soothes and calms emotions. In battle, it gives off more of its becalming scent to blunt the foe's fighting spirit.", "Ilha Gengibre (Selva Tropical) & Bosque Secreto", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Starter", PokemonType.Grass, null, 1.8f, 100.5f);
		Add(entries, 155, "Cyndaquil", "Fire Mouse", "It flares flames from its back to protect itself. The fire burns vigorously if the Pokémon is angry. When it is tired, it sputters with incomplete combustion.", "Caverna da Caveira & Forja do Vulcão", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Starter", PokemonType.Fire, null, 0.5f, 7.9f);
		Add(entries, 156, "Quilava", "Volcano", "It intimidates foes with intense gusts of flames and superheated air. Its quick nimbleness lets it dodge attacks even while scorching an enemy.", "Vulcão da Ilha Gengibre & Minas de Lava (80-120)", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Starter", PokemonType.Fire, null, 0.9f, 19.0f);
		Add(entries, 157, "Typhlosion", "Volcano", "It can hide behind a shimmering heat haze that it creates using its intense flames. Typhlosion create blazing explosive blasts that burn everything to cinders.", "Deserto de Calico & Encostas do Vulcão da Ilha", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Starter", PokemonType.Fire, null, 1.7f, 79.5f);
		Add(entries, 158, "Totodile", "Big Jaw", "Despite its small body, Totodile's jaws are very powerful. While it may think it is just playfully nipping, its bite has enough strength to cause serious injury.", "Ilha Gengibre (Costa Sul & Rio Tropical) & Praia", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Starter", PokemonType.Water, null, 0.6f, 9.5f);
		Add(entries, 159, "Croconaw", "Big Jaw", "Once its jaws clamp down on its foe, it will absolutely not let go. Because the tips of its fangs are forked back like fishhooks, they become irremovably embedded.", "Praia dos Pelicanos, Oceano & Ilha Gengibre (Praia Tropical)", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Starter", PokemonType.Water, null, 1.1f, 25.0f);
		Add(entries, 160, "Feraligatr", "Big Jaw", "It opens its huge mouth to intimidate enemies. In battle, it runs using its thick and powerful hind legs to charge the foe with incredible speed.", "Rios da Floresta Cinzenta, Lago da Montanha & Ilha Tropical", "Primavera, Verão & Outono", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Starter", PokemonType.Water, null, 2.3f, 88.8f);
		Add(entries, 161, "Sentret", "Scout", "They take turns standing guard when it is time to sleep. The sentry awakens the others if it senses danger. If one becomes separated, it turns sleepless with fear.", "Deserto de Calico, Fazenda & Arredores da Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, null, 0.8f, 6.0f);
		Add(entries, 162, "Furret", "Long Body", "A Furret has a very slim build. When under attack, it can squirm through narrow spaces and get away. In spite of its short limbs, it is very nimble and fleet.", "Fazenda, Vila Pelicanos & Floresta Cinzenta", "Primavera & Verão", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, null, 1.8f, 32.5f);
		Add(entries, 163, "Hoothoot", "Owl", "It has an internal organ that senses the earth's rotation. Using this special organ, a Hoothoot begins hooting at precisely the same time every day.", "Montanha, Ponto de Ônibus & Ilha Gengibre", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, PokemonType.Flying, 0.7f, 21.2f);
		Add(entries, 164, "Noctowl", "Owl", "It unfailingly catches prey in darkness. Noctowl owe their success to superior vision that allows them to see in minimal light, and to their supple and silent wings.", "Deserto de Calico, Fazenda & Arredores da Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, PokemonType.Flying, 1.6f, 40.8f);
		Add(entries, 165, "Ledyba", "Five Star", "Ledyba communicate using a fluid that they secrete from where the legs join the body. They are said to convey feelings to others by altering the fluid's scent.", "Floresta Cinzenta, Bosque Secreto & Fazenda", "Todas as Estações (Ano Inteiro)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Bug, PokemonType.Flying, 1.0f, 10.8f);
		Add(entries, 166, "Ledian", "Five Star", "It is said that in lands with clean air, where the stars fill the sky, there live many Ledian. For good reason, they use the light of the stars as energy.", "Ilha Gengibre (Selva Tropical) & Bosque Secreto", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Bug, PokemonType.Flying, 1.4f, 35.6f);
		Add(entries, 167, "Spinarak", "String Spit", "The web it spins can be considered its second nervous system. It is said that a Spinarak determines its prey by the tiny vibrations it feels through the web.", "Bosque Secreto Noturno, Esgotos & Pantanal da Bruxa", "Outono & Inverno", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Bug, PokemonType.Poison, 0.5f, 8.5f);
		Add(entries, 168, "Ariados", "Long Leg", "Its feet are tipped with tiny hooked claws that enable it to scuttle on ceilings and vertical walls. It constricts its foe with thin and strong silk webbing.", "Esgotos dos Pelicanos, Covil dos Insetos & Bosque Secreto", "Primavera, Verão & Outono", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Bug, PokemonType.Poison, 1.1f, 33.5f);
		Add(entries, 169, "Crobat", "Bat", "Over the course of evolution, its hind legs turned into wings. By alternately resting its front and rear wings, it can fly all day without having to stop.", "Minas Profundas (80-120), Caverna da Caveira & Cemitério", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Poison, PokemonType.Flying, 1.8f, 75.0f);
		Add(entries, 170, "Chinchou", "Angler", "When it senses danger, it discharges positive and negative electricity from its two antennae. It lives in depths beyond sunlight's reach.", "Ilha Gengibre (Costa Sul & Rio Tropical) & Praia", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, PokemonType.Electric, 0.5f, 12.0f);
		Add(entries, 171, "Lanturn", "Light", "The light-emitting orbs on its back are very bright. They are formed from a part of its dorsal fin. This Pokémon illuminates the inky darkness of deep seas.", "Praia dos Pelicanos, Oceano & Ilha Gengibre (Praia Tropical)", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Tempestade de Raios ou Chuva", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, PokemonType.Electric, 1.2f, 22.5f);
		Add(entries, 172, "Pichu", "Tiny Mouse", "Pichu habita os ecossistemas naturais da região e possui habilidades únicas.", "Montanha, Ferrovia, Torre do Mago & Deserto de Calico", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Tempestade de Raios ou Chuva", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Electric, null, 0.3f, 2.0f);
		Add(entries, 173, "Cleffa", "Star Shape", "On nights with many shooting stars, Cleffa can be seen dancing in a ring. They dance until daybreak, when they quench their thirst with the morning dew.", "Arredores da Vila Pelicanos, Fazenda & Floresta", "Todas as Estações (Ano Inteiro)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Fairy, null, 0.3f, 3.0f);
		Add(entries, 174, "Igglybuff", "Balloon", "Its soft and pliable body is very bouncy. When it sings continuously with all its might, its body steadily turns a deepening pink color.", "Floresta Cinzenta, Bosque Secreto & Fazenda", "Primavera & Verão", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, PokemonType.Fairy, 0.3f, 1.0f);
		Add(entries, 175, "Togepi", "Spike Ball", "As its energy, it uses the feelings of compassion and pleasure exuded by people and Pokémon. It stores up happy feelings in its shell, then shares them out.", "Ilha Gengibre (Selva Tropical) & Bosque Secreto", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Fairy, null, 0.3f, 1.5f);
		Add(entries, 176, "Togetic", "Happiness", "It is said to be a Pokémon that brings good fortune. When it spots someone who is pure of heart, a Togetic appears and shares its happiness with that person.", "Arredores da Vila Pelicanos, Fazenda & Floresta", "Primavera, Verão & Outono", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, PokemonType.Fairy, 0.6f, 3.2f);
		Add(entries, 177, "Natu", "Tiny Bird", "It runs up short trees that grow on the savanna to peck at new shoots. A Natu's eyes look as if they are always observing something.", "Ilha Gengibre (Ruínas Tropicais), Ferrovia & Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Psychic, PokemonType.Flying, 0.2f, 2.0f);
		Add(entries, 178, "Xatu", "Mystic", "It has the enigmatic power of foreseeing the future. Some people in different lands have long believed that Xatu are emissaries from another world.", "Montanha, Ferrovia, Torre do Mago & Deserto de Calico", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Psychic, PokemonType.Flying, 1.5f, 15.0f);
		Add(entries, 179, "Mareep", "Wool", "Its fluffy wool rubs together and builds a static charge. The more energy is charged, the more brightly the lightbulb at the tip of its tail glows.", "Ilha Gengibre (Ruínas Tropicais), Ferrovia & Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Tempestade de Raios ou Chuva", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Electric, null, 0.6f, 7.8f);
		Add(entries, 180, "Flaaffy", "Wool", "Its fleece quality changes to generate strong static electricity with a small amount of wool. The bare, slick parts of its hide are shielded against electricity.", "Montanha, Ferrovia, Torre do Mago & Deserto de Calico", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Tempestade de Raios ou Chuva", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Electric, null, 0.8f, 13.3f);
		Add(entries, 181, "Ampharos", "Light", "It gives off so much light that it can be seen even from space. People in the old days used its light to send signals back and forth with others far away.", "Ilha Gengibre (Ruínas Tropicais), Ferrovia & Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Tempestade de Raios ou Chuva", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Electric, null, 1.4f, 61.5f);
		Add(entries, 182, "Bellossom", "Flower", "Its flower petals deepen in color through exposure to sunlight. When cloudy weather persists, it does a dance that is thought to be a ritual for summoning the sun.", "Arredores da Vila Pelicanos, Fazenda & Floresta", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Grass, null, 0.4f, 5.8f);
		Add(entries, 183, "Marill", "Aqua Mouse", "Its body is covered with water-repellent fur. Because of the fur, it can swim through water at high speed without being slowed by the water's resistance.", "Praia dos Pelicanos, Oceano & Ilha Gengibre (Praia Tropical)", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, PokemonType.Fairy, 0.4f, 8.5f);
		Add(entries, 184, "Azumarill", "Aqua Rabbit", "It lives in water virtually all day long. Its body color and pattern act as camouflage that makes it tough for enemies to spot in water.", "Rios da Floresta Cinzenta, Lago da Montanha & Ilha Tropical", "Primavera, Verão & Outono", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, PokemonType.Fairy, 0.8f, 28.5f);
		Add(entries, 185, "Sudowoodo", "Imitation", "It mimics a tree to avoid being attacked by enemies. But since its forelegs remain green throughout the year, it is easily identified as a fake in the winter.", "Caverna da Caveira, Deserto de Calico & Vulcão", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Rock, null, 1.2f, 38.0f);
		Add(entries, 186, "Politoed", "Frog", "The curled hair on its head proves its status as a king. It is said that the longer and curlier the hair, the more respect it earns from its peers.", "Praia dos Pelicanos, Oceano & Ilha Gengibre (Praia Tropical)", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, null, 1.1f, 33.9f);
		Add(entries, 187, "Hoppip", "Cottonweed", "This Pokémon drifts and floats with the wind. If it senses the approach of strong winds, a Hoppip links leaves with others to prepare against being blown away.", "Ilha Gengibre (Selva Tropical) & Bosque Secreto", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Grass, PokemonType.Flying, 0.4f, 0.5f);
		Add(entries, 188, "Skiploom", "Cottonweed", "It blossoms when the temperature rises above 64 degrees F. Because its flower's blooming changes with the temperature, it is sometimes used as a thermometer.", "Arredores da Vila Pelicanos, Fazenda & Floresta", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Grass, PokemonType.Flying, 0.6f, 1.0f);
		Add(entries, 189, "Jumpluff", "Cottonweed", "Jumpluff ride warm southern winds to cross the sea and fly to foreign lands. This Pokémon lands when it encounters cold air while it is floating.", "Floresta Cinzenta, Bosque Secreto & Fazenda", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Grass, PokemonType.Flying, 0.8f, 3.0f);
		Add(entries, 190, "Aipom", "Long Tail", "Its tail ends with a dexterous, handlike appendage. However, because it uses the tail so much, Aipom's real hands have become rather clumsy.", "Montanha, Ponto de Ônibus & Ilha Gengibre", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, null, 0.8f, 11.5f);
		Add(entries, 191, "Sunkern", "Seed", "Sunkern try to minimize movement to conserve the nutrients they have stored in their bodies for evolution. They will not eat, subsisting only on morning dew.", "Arredores da Vila Pelicanos, Fazenda & Floresta", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Grass, null, 0.3f, 1.8f);
		Add(entries, 192, "Sunflora", "Sun", "Sunflora convert solar energy into nutrition. They are highly active in the warm daytime but suddenly stop moving as soon as the sun sets.", "Floresta Cinzenta, Bosque Secreto & Fazenda", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Grass, null, 0.8f, 8.5f);
		Add(entries, 193, "Yanma", "Clear Wing", "It can see 360 degrees without moving its eyes. It is a great flier capable of making sudden stops and turning midair to quickly chase down targeted prey.", "Ilha Gengibre (Selva Tropical) & Bosque Secreto", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Bug, PokemonType.Flying, 1.2f, 38.0f);
		Add(entries, 194, "Wooper", "Water Fish", "Wooper usually live in water but come out onto land seeking food occasionally. On land, they coat their bodies with a gooey, toxic film.", "Caverna da Caveira, Deserto de Calico & Vulcão", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, PokemonType.Ground, 0.4f, 8.5f);
		Add(entries, 195, "Quagsire", "Water Fish", "A Quagsire hunts by leaving its mouth wide open in water and waiting for its prey to blunder in. Because it doesn't move, it does not get very hungry.", "Deserto de Calico, Pedreira & Caverna da Caveira", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, PokemonType.Ground, 1.4f, 75.0f);
		Add(entries, 196, "Espeon", "Sun", "An Espeon is extremely loyal to any Trainer it considers to be worthy. It is said to have developed precognitive powers to protect its Trainer from harm.", "Montanha, Ferrovia, Torre do Mago & Deserto de Calico", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Psychic, null, 0.9f, 26.5f);
		Add(entries, 197, "Umbreon", "Moonlight", "Umbreon evolved from exposure to the moon's energy pulses. It lurks in darkness and waits for its foes to move. The rings on its body glow when it leaps to attack.", "Bosque Secreto Noturno, Esgotos & Pantanal da Bruxa", "Todas as Estações (Ano Inteiro)", "Noite Nebulosa, Chuva ou Céu Limpo", "Noturno (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Dark, null, 1.0f, 27.0f);
		Add(entries, 198, "Murkrow", "Darkness", "Murkrow were feared as the alleged bearers of ill fortune. It shows strong interest in anything that sparkles. It will even try to steal rings from women.", "Esgotos dos Pelicanos, Covil dos Insetos & Bosque Secreto", "Primavera & Verão", "Noite Nebulosa, Chuva ou Céu Limpo", "Noturno (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Dark, PokemonType.Flying, 0.5f, 2.1f);
		Add(entries, 199, "Slowking", "Royal", "It undertakes research every day to solve the mysteries of the world. However, it apparently forgets everything if the Shellder on its head comes off.", "Rios da Floresta Cinzenta, Lago da Montanha & Ilha Tropical", "Outono & Inverno", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, PokemonType.Psychic, 2.0f, 79.5f);
		Add(entries, 200, "Misdreavus", "Screech", "A Misdreavus frightens people with a creepy, sobbing cry. It apparently uses its red spheres to absorb the fear of foes as its nutrition.", "Bosque Secreto Noturno, Esgotos & Pantanal da Bruxa", "Primavera, Verão & Outono", "Noite Nebulosa, Chuva ou Céu Limpo", "Noturno (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Ghost, null, 0.7f, 1.0f);
		Add(entries, 201, "Unown", "Espécie", "Unown habita os ecossistemas naturais da região e possui habilidades únicas.", "Ilha Gengibre (Ruínas Tropicais), Ferrovia & Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Psychic, null, 1.0f, 20.0f);
		Add(entries, 202, "Wobbuffet", "Patient", "Usually docile, a Wobbuffet strikes back ferociously if its black tail is attacked. It makes its lair in caves where it waits for nightfall.", "Montanha, Ferrovia, Torre do Mago & Deserto de Calico", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Psychic, null, 1.3f, 28.5f);
		Add(entries, 203, "Girafarig", "Long Neck", "A Girafarig is an herbivore--it eats grass and tree shoots. While it is eating, its tail makes chewing and swallowing motions as if it were also eating.", "Ilha Gengibre (Ruínas Tropicais), Ferrovia & Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, PokemonType.Psychic, 1.5f, 41.5f);
		Add(entries, 204, "Pineco", "Bagworm", "A Pineco hangs from a tree branch and waits for prey. While eating, if it is disturbed by someone shaking its tree, it falls on the ground and suddenly explodes.", "Floresta Cinzenta, Bosque Secreto & Fazenda", "Primavera, Verão & Outono", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Bug, null, 0.6f, 7.2f);
		Add(entries, 205, "Forretress", "Bagworm", "It keeps itself inside its steel shell. The shell is opened when it is catching prey, but it is so quick that the shell's inside cannot be seen.", "Minas da Montanha (1-39), Pedreira & Deserto", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Bug, PokemonType.Steel, 1.2f, 125.8f);
		Add(entries, 206, "Dunsparce", "Land Snake", "Its drill-tipped tail is used to burrow into the ground backwards. This Pokémon is known to make its nest in complex shapes deep under the ground.", "Deserto de Calico, Fazenda & Arredores da Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, null, 1.5f, 14.0f);
		Add(entries, 207, "Gligar", "Fly Scorpion", "It glides without making a single sound. It grasps the face of its foe using its hind and large front claws, then stabs with its poison barb.", "Deserto de Calico, Pedreira & Caverna da Caveira", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Ground, PokemonType.Flying, 1.1f, 64.8f);
		Add(entries, 208, "Steelix", "Iron Snake", "Steelix live even further underground than Onix. This Pokémon is known to dig toward the earth's core, reaching a depth of over six-tenths of a mile underground.", "Minas da Montanha (1-39), Pedreira & Deserto", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Steel, PokemonType.Ground, 9.2f, 400.0f);
		Add(entries, 209, "Snubbull", "Fairy", "By baring its fangs and making a scary face, it sends smaller Pokémon scurrying in terror. The Snubbull does seem a little sad at making its foes flee.", "Arredores da Vila Pelicanos, Fazenda & Floresta", "Todas as Estações (Ano Inteiro)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Fairy, null, 0.6f, 7.8f);
		Add(entries, 210, "Granbull", "Fairy", "It has a particularly well-developed lower jaw. The huge fangs are heavy, causing it to tilt its head. Unless it is startled, it will not try to bite.", "Floresta Cinzenta, Bosque Secreto & Fazenda", "Primavera & Verão", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Fairy, null, 1.4f, 48.7f);
		Add(entries, 211, "Qwilfish", "Balloon", "A Qwilfish uses the pressure of water it swallows to shoot toxic quills all at once from all over its body. It finds swimming to be somewhat challenging.", "Rios da Floresta Cinzenta, Lago da Montanha & Ilha Tropical", "Outono & Inverno", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, PokemonType.Poison, 0.5f, 3.9f);
		Add(entries, 212, "Scizor", "Pincer", "A Scizor has a body with the hardness of steel. It is not easily fazed by ordinary sorts of attacks. It flaps its wings to regulate its body temperature.", "Caverna da Caveira, Deserto de Calico & Vulcão", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Bug, PokemonType.Steel, 1.8f, 118.0f);
		Add(entries, 213, "Shuckle", "Mold", "A Shuckle hides under rocks, keeping its body concealed inside its shell while eating stored berries. The berries mix with its body fluids to become a juice.", "Deserto de Calico, Pedreira & Caverna da Caveira", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Bug, PokemonType.Rock, 0.6f, 20.5f);
		Add(entries, 214, "Heracross", "Single Horn", "They gather in forests seeking the sweet sap of trees. It is completely clad in a steel-hard shell. It is proud of its horn, which it uses to fling foes.", "Ilha Gengibre (Selva Tropical) & Bosque Secreto", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Bug, PokemonType.Fighting, 1.5f, 54.0f);
		Add(entries, 215, "Sneasel", "Sharp Claw", "A Sneasel scales trees by punching its hooked claws into the bark. It seeks out unguarded nests and steals eggs for food while the parents are away.", "Pico da Montanha, Ferrovia & Floresta no Inverno", "Inverno (Qualquer estação nas Minas 40-79)", "Noite Nebulosa, Chuva ou Céu Limpo", "Noturno (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Dark, PokemonType.Ice, 0.9f, 28.0f);
		Add(entries, 216, "Teddiursa", "Little Bear", "It licks its palms that are sweetened by being soaked in honey. A Teddiursa makes its own honey by blending fruits and pollen collected by Beedrill.", "Fazenda, Vila Pelicanos & Floresta Cinzenta", "Primavera, Verão & Outono", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, null, 0.6f, 8.8f);
		Add(entries, 217, "Ursaring", "Hibernator", "In forests, it is said that there are many streams and towering trees where an Ursaring gathers food. It walks through its forest collecting food every day.", "Montanha, Ponto de Ônibus & Ilha Gengibre", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, null, 1.8f, 125.8f);
		Add(entries, 218, "Slugma", "Lava", "It is a species of Pokémon that lives in volcanic areas. If its body cools, its skin hardens and immobilizes it. To avoid that, it sleeps near magma.", "Caverna da Caveira & Forja do Vulcão", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Fire, null, 0.7f, 35.0f);
		Add(entries, 219, "Magcargo", "Lava", "The shell on its back is made of hardened magma. Tens of thousands of years spent living in volcanic craters have turned Magcargo's bodies into magma.", "Vulcão da Ilha Gengibre & Minas de Lava (80-120)", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Fire, PokemonType.Rock, 0.8f, 55.0f);
		Add(entries, 220, "Swinub", "Pig", "It roots for food by rubbing its snout against the ground. Its favorite food is a mushroom that grows under dried grass. It occasionally roots out hot springs.", "Minas Congeladas (Andares 40-79) & Montanha no Inverno", "Inverno (Qualquer estação nas Minas 40-79)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Ice, PokemonType.Ground, 0.4f, 6.5f);
		Add(entries, 221, "Piloswine", "Swine", "A Piloswine is covered by a thick coat of long hair for enduring freezing cold. It uses its tusks to dig up food that has been buried under ice.", "Pico da Montanha, Ferrovia & Floresta no Inverno", "Inverno (Qualquer estação nas Minas 40-79)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Ice, PokemonType.Ground, 1.1f, 55.8f);
		Add(entries, 222, "Corsola", "Coral", "Corsola live in warm southern seas. If the sea becomes polluted, the beautiful coral stalks become discolored and crumble away in tatters.", "Deserto de Calico, Pedreira & Caverna da Caveira", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, PokemonType.Rock, 0.6f, 5.0f);
		Add(entries, 223, "Remoraid", "Jet", "A Remoraid uses its abdominal muscles to forcefully expel swallowed water, then shoot down flying prey. When evolution approaches, it travels down rivers.", "Rios da Floresta Cinzenta, Lago da Montanha & Ilha Tropical", "Outono & Inverno", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, null, 0.6f, 12.0f);
		Add(entries, 224, "Octillery", "Jet", "It ensnares its foe with its suction- cupped tentacles before delivering the finishing blow. If the foe turns out to be too strong, it spews ink to escape.", "Ilha Gengibre (Costa Sul & Rio Tropical) & Praia", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, null, 0.9f, 28.5f);
		Add(entries, 225, "Delibird", "Delivery", "It carries food bundled up in its tail. There was a famous explorer who managed to scale Mt. Everest thanks to a Delibird sharing its food.", "Pico da Montanha, Ferrovia & Floresta no Inverno", "Inverno (Qualquer estação nas Minas 40-79)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Ice, PokemonType.Flying, 0.9f, 16.0f);
		Add(entries, 226, "Mantine", "Kite", "On sunny days, schools of Mantine can be seen elegantly leaping over the waves. It is not bothered by the Remoraid that hitches rides.", "Rios da Floresta Cinzenta, Lago da Montanha & Ilha Tropical", "Primavera & Verão", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, PokemonType.Flying, 2.1f, 220.0f);
		Add(entries, 227, "Skarmory", "Armor Bird", "A Pokémon that has a body and wings of steel. People in the past used feathers fallen from Skarmory to make swords and knives.", "Caverna da Caveira, Deserto de Calico & Vulcão", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Steel, PokemonType.Flying, 1.7f, 50.5f);
		Add(entries, 228, "Houndour", "Dark", "Houndour communicate with each other using a variety of cries to corner their prey. This Pokémon's remarkable teamwork is simply unparalleled.", "Vulcão da Ilha Gengibre & Minas de Lava (80-120)", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Noturno (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Dark, PokemonType.Fire, 0.6f, 10.8f);
		Add(entries, 229, "Houndoom", "Dark", "In a Houndoom pack, the one with its horns raked sharply back serves a leadership role. They choose their leader by fighting among themselves.", "Deserto de Calico & Encostas do Vulcão da Ilha", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Noturno (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Dark, PokemonType.Fire, 1.4f, 35.0f);
		Add(entries, 230, "Kingdra", "Dragon", "It sleeps quietly, deep on the seafloor. When it comes up to the surface, it creates a huge whirlpool that can swallow even ships.", "Ilha Gengibre (Costa Sul & Rio Tropical) & Praia", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, PokemonType.Dragon, 1.8f, 152.0f);
		Add(entries, 231, "Phanpy", "Long Nose", "Phanpy's big ears serve as broad fans. When it becomes hot, it flaps the ears busily to cool down. Even the young are very strong.", "Deserto de Calico, Pedreira & Caverna da Caveira", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Ground, null, 0.5f, 33.5f);
		Add(entries, 232, "Donphan", "Armor", "A Donphan is so strong it can easily haul a dump truck. Its hide has toughened to a rock-hard state. An ordinary sort of attack won't even leave a scratch.", "Minas da Montanha (1-39), Pedreira & Deserto", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Ground, null, 1.1f, 120.0f);
		Add(entries, 233, "Porygon2", "Virtual", "It was created by humans using the power of science. It has been given artificial intelligence that enables it to learn new gestures and emotions on its own.", "Deserto de Calico, Fazenda & Arredores da Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, null, 0.6f, 32.5f);
		Add(entries, 234, "Stantler", "Big Horn", "Stantler's magnificent antlers were once traded at high prices as works of art. As a result, this Pokémon was hunted close to extinction.", "Fazenda, Vila Pelicanos & Floresta Cinzenta", "Primavera & Verão", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, null, 1.4f, 71.2f);
		Add(entries, 235, "Smeargle", "Painter", "A Smeargle marks its territory using a fluid that leaks out from the tip of its tail. About 5,000 different marks left by this Pokémon have been found.", "Montanha, Ponto de Ônibus & Ilha Gengibre", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, null, 1.2f, 58.0f);
		Add(entries, 236, "Tyrogue", "Scuffle", "Tyrogue become stressed out if they do not get to train every day. When raising this Pokémon, the Trainer must establish a regular training schedule.", "Deserto de Calico, Fazenda & Arredores da Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Fighting, null, 0.7f, 21.0f);
		Add(entries, 237, "Hitmontop", "Handstand", "Its technique of kicking while spinning is a remarkable mix of both offense and defense. Hitmontop travel faster spinning than they do walking.", "Fazenda, Vila Pelicanos & Floresta Cinzenta", "Todas as Estações (Ano Inteiro)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Fighting, null, 1.4f, 48.0f);
		Add(entries, 238, "Smoochum", "Kiss", "It actively runs about, but also falls often. Whenever it falls, it will check its reflection on a lake's surface to make sure its face hasn't become dirty.", "Minas Congeladas (Andares 40-79) & Montanha no Inverno", "Inverno (Qualquer estação nas Minas 40-79)", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Ice, PokemonType.Psychic, 0.4f, 6.0f);
		Add(entries, 239, "Elekid", "Electric", "If it touches metal and discharges the electricity it has stored in its body, an Elekid begins swinging its arms in circles to recharge itself.", "Ilha Gengibre (Ruínas Tropicais), Ferrovia & Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Tempestade de Raios ou Chuva", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Electric, null, 0.6f, 23.5f);
		Add(entries, 240, "Magby", "Live Coal", "If a Magby is spouting yellow flames from its mouth, it is in good health. When it is fatigued, black smoke will be mixed in with the flames.", "Vulcão da Ilha Gengibre & Minas de Lava (80-120)", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Fire, null, 0.7f, 21.4f);
		Add(entries, 241, "Miltank", "Milk Cow", "It gives over five gallons of milk daily. Its sweet milk is enjoyed by children and grown-ups alike. People who can't drink milk turn it into yogurt and eat it instead.", "Montanha, Ponto de Ônibus & Ilha Gengibre", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, null, 1.2f, 75.5f);
		Add(entries, 242, "Blissey", "Happiness", "If it senses sadness with its fluffy fur, a Blissey will rush over to the sad person, however far away, to share an egg of happiness that brings a smile to any face.", "Deserto de Calico, Fazenda & Arredores da Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, null, 1.5f, 46.8f);
		Add(entries, 243, "Raikou", "Thunder", "Raikou embodies the speed of lightning. Its roars send shock waves shuddering through the air and ground as if lightning bolts were crashing down.", "Cume do Vale (The Summit), Caverna da Caveira & Vulcão", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Tempestade de Raios ou Chuva", "Crepúsculo & Noite Profunda (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Legendary", PokemonType.Electric, null, 1.9f, 178.0f);
		Add(entries, 244, "Entei", "Volcano", "Entei embodies the passion of magma. It is thought to have been born in the eruption of a volcano. It blasts fire that consumes all that it touches.", "Vulcão da Ilha Gengibre (Caldeira) & Caverna da Caveira", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Amanhecer Dourado (06:00h às 10:00h)", "Legendary", PokemonType.Fire, null, 2.1f, 198.0f);
		Add(entries, 245, "Suicune", "Aurora", "Suicune embodies the compassion of a pure spring of water. It runs across the land with gliding elegance. It has the power to purify dirty water.", "Ilha Gengibre (Recife Oeste) & Profundezas Oceânicas", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Meia-Noite (22:00h às 02:00h)", "Legendary", PokemonType.Water, null, 2.0f, 187.0f);
		Add(entries, 246, "Larvitar", "Rock Skin", "A Larvitar is born deep under the ground. It must eat its way through the soil above and reach the surface for it to see its parents' faces.", "Deserto de Calico, Pedreira & Caverna da Caveira", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Rock, PokemonType.Ground, 0.6f, 72.0f);
		Add(entries, 247, "Pupitar", "Hard Shell", "A Pupitar creates a gas inside its body that it ejects under compression to propel itself like a jet. Its body can withstand a collision with solid steel.", "Minas da Montanha (1-39), Pedreira & Deserto", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Rock, PokemonType.Ground, 1.2f, 152.0f);
		Add(entries, 248, "Tyranitar", "Armor", "A Tyranitar is so overwhelmingly powerful, it can bring down a whole mountain to make its nest. It roams in mountains seeking new opponents to fight.", "Caverna da Caveira, Deserto de Calico & Vulcão", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Noite Nebulosa, Chuva ou Céu Limpo", "Noturno (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Rock, PokemonType.Dark, 2.0f, 202.0f);
		Add(entries, 249, "Lugia", "Diving", "Lugia is so powerful even a light fluttering of its wings can blow apart houses. As a result, it chooses to live out of sight deep under the sea.", "Bosque Secreto, Santuário da Ilha & Cume do Vale", "Todas as Estações (Ano Inteiro)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Crepúsculo & Noite Profunda (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Legendary", PokemonType.Psychic, PokemonType.Flying, 5.2f, 216.0f);
		Add(entries, 250, "Ho-Oh", "Rainbow", "Its feathers--which glow in seven colors depending on the angle at which they are struck by light--are thought to bring joy. It is said to live at the foot of a rainbow.", "Vulcão da Ilha Gengibre (Caldeira) & Caverna da Caveira", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Amanhecer Dourado (06:00h às 10:00h)", "Legendary", PokemonType.Fire, PokemonType.Flying, 3.8f, 199.0f);
		Add(entries, 251, "Celebi", "Time Travel", "This Pokémon came from the future by crossing over time. It is thought that so long as Celebi appears, a bright and shining future awaits us.", "Bosque Secreto, Santuário da Ilha & Cume do Vale", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Meia-Noite (22:00h às 02:00h)", "Mythical", PokemonType.Psychic, PokemonType.Grass, 0.6f, 5.0f);
		Add(entries, 252, "Treecko", "Wood Gecko", "It makes its nest in a giant tree in the forest. It ferociously guards against anything nearing its territory. It is said to be the protector of the forest's trees.", "Floresta Cinzenta, Bosque Secreto & Fazenda", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Starter", PokemonType.Grass, null, 0.5f, 5.0f);
		Add(entries, 253, "Grovyle", "Wood Gecko", "Leaves grow out of this Pokémon's body. They help obscure a Grovyle from the eyes of its enemies while it is in a thickly overgrown forest.", "Ilha Gengibre (Selva Tropical) & Bosque Secreto", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Starter", PokemonType.Grass, null, 0.9f, 21.6f);
		Add(entries, 254, "Sceptile", "Forest", "In the jungle, its power is without equal. This Pokémon carefully grows trees and plants. It regulates its body temperature by basking in sunlight.", "Arredores da Vila Pelicanos, Fazenda & Floresta", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Starter", PokemonType.Grass, null, 1.7f, 52.2f);
		Add(entries, 255, "Torchic", "Chick", "If attacked, it strikes back by spitting balls of fire it forms in its stomach. A Torchic dislikes darkness because it can't see its surroundings.", "Vulcão da Ilha Gengibre & Minas de Lava (80-120)", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Starter", PokemonType.Fire, null, 0.4f, 2.5f);
		Add(entries, 256, "Combusken", "Young Fowl", "It lashes out with 10 kicks per second. Its strong fighting instinct compels it to keep up its offensive until the opponent gives up.", "Deserto de Calico & Encostas do Vulcão da Ilha", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Starter", PokemonType.Fire, PokemonType.Fighting, 0.9f, 19.5f);
		Add(entries, 257, "Blaziken", "Blaze", "It learns martial arts that use punches and kicks. Every several years, its old feathers burn off, and new, supple feathers grow back in their place.", "Caverna da Caveira & Forja do Vulcão", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Starter", PokemonType.Fire, PokemonType.Fighting, 1.9f, 52.0f);
		Add(entries, 258, "Mudkip", "Mud Fish", "On land, it can powerfully lift large boulders by planting its four feet and heaving. It sleeps by burying itself in soil at the water's edge.", "Praia dos Pelicanos, Oceano & Ilha Gengibre (Praia Tropical)", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Starter", PokemonType.Water, null, 0.4f, 7.6f);
		Add(entries, 259, "Marshtomp", "Mud Fish", "Its toughened hind legs enable it to stand upright. Because it weakens if its skin dries out, it replenishes fluids by playing in mud.", "Minas da Montanha (1-39), Pedreira & Deserto", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Starter", PokemonType.Water, PokemonType.Ground, 0.7f, 28.0f);
		Add(entries, 260, "Swampert", "Mud Fish", "If it senses the approach of a storm and a tidal wave, it protects its seaside nest by piling up boulders. It swims as fast as a jet ski.", "Caverna da Caveira, Deserto de Calico & Vulcão", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Starter", PokemonType.Water, PokemonType.Ground, 1.5f, 81.9f);
		Add(entries, 261, "Poochyena", "Bite", "It savagely threatens foes with bared fangs. It chases after fleeing targets tenaciously. It turns tail and runs, however, if the foe strikes back.", "Esgotos dos Pelicanos, Covil dos Insetos & Bosque Secreto", "Todas as Estações (Ano Inteiro)", "Noite Nebulosa, Chuva ou Céu Limpo", "Noturno (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Dark, null, 0.5f, 13.6f);
		Add(entries, 262, "Mightyena", "Bite", "In the wild, Mightyena live in a pack. They never defy their leader's orders. They defeat foes with perfectly coordinated teamwork.", "Minas Profundas (80-120), Caverna da Caveira & Cemitério", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Noite Nebulosa, Chuva ou Céu Limpo", "Noturno (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Dark, null, 1.0f, 37.0f);
		Add(entries, 263, "Zigzagoon", "Tiny Raccoon", "Rubbing its nose against the ground, it always wanders about back and forth in search of something. It is distinguished by the zigzag footprints it leaves.", "Deserto de Calico, Fazenda & Arredores da Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, null, 0.4f, 17.5f);
		Add(entries, 264, "Linoone", "Rushing", "It is exceedingly fast if it only has to run in a straight line. When it spots pond- dwelling prey underwater, it quickly leaps in and catches it with its sharp claws.", "Fazenda, Vila Pelicanos & Floresta Cinzenta", "Primavera, Verão & Outono", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, null, 0.5f, 32.5f);
		Add(entries, 265, "Wurmple", "Worm", "It sticks to tree branches and eats leaves. The thread it spits from its mouth, which becomes gooey when it touches air, slows the movement of its foes.", "Ilha Gengibre (Selva Tropical) & Bosque Secreto", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Bug, null, 0.3f, 3.6f);
		Add(entries, 266, "Silcoon", "Cocoon", "It prepares for evolution using the energy it stored while it was a Wurmple. It keeps watch over the surroundings with its two eyes.", "Arredores da Vila Pelicanos, Fazenda & Floresta", "Primavera & Verão", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Bug, null, 0.6f, 10.0f);
		Add(entries, 267, "Beautifly", "Butterfly", "Its colorfully patterned wings are its most prominent feature. It flies through flower-covered fields collecting pollen. It attacks ferociously when angered.", "Floresta Cinzenta, Bosque Secreto & Fazenda", "Outono & Inverno", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Bug, PokemonType.Flying, 1.0f, 28.4f);
		Add(entries, 268, "Cascoon", "Cocoon", "To avoid detection by its enemies, it hides motionlessly beneath large leaves and in the gaps of branches. It also attaches dead leaves to its body for camouflage.", "Ilha Gengibre (Selva Tropical) & Bosque Secreto", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Bug, null, 0.7f, 11.5f);
		Add(entries, 269, "Dustox", "Poison Moth", "It is a nocturnal Pokémon that flies from fields and mountains to the attraction of streetlights at night. It looses highly toxic powder from its wings.", "Bosque Secreto Noturno, Esgotos & Pantanal da Bruxa", "Todas as Estações (Ano Inteiro)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Bug, PokemonType.Poison, 1.2f, 31.6f);
		Add(entries, 270, "Lotad", "Water Weed", "This Pokémon lives in ponds with clean water. It is known to ferry small Pokémon across ponds by carrying them on the broad leaf on its head.", "Praia dos Pelicanos, Oceano & Ilha Gengibre (Praia Tropical)", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, PokemonType.Grass, 0.5f, 2.6f);
		Add(entries, 271, "Lombre", "Jolly", "In the evening, it takes great delight in popping out of rivers and startling people. It feeds on aquatic moss that grows on rocks in the riverbed.", "Rios da Floresta Cinzenta, Lago da Montanha & Ilha Tropical", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, PokemonType.Grass, 1.2f, 32.5f);
		Add(entries, 272, "Ludicolo", "Carefree", "When it hears festive music, all the cells in its body become stimulated, and it begins moving in rhythm. It does not quail even when it faces a tough opponent.", "Ilha Gengibre (Costa Sul & Rio Tropical) & Praia", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, PokemonType.Grass, 1.5f, 55.0f);
		Add(entries, 273, "Seedot", "Acorn", "It hangs off branches and absorbs nutrients. When it finishes eating, its body becomes so heavy that it drops to the ground with a thump.", "Floresta Cinzenta, Bosque Secreto & Fazenda", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Grass, null, 0.5f, 4.0f);
		Add(entries, 274, "Nuzleaf", "Wily", "A forest-dwelling Pokémon that is skilled at climbing trees. Its long and pointed nose is its weak point. It loses power if the nose is gripped.", "Minas Profundas (80-120), Caverna da Caveira & Cemitério", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Noite Nebulosa, Chuva ou Céu Limpo", "Noturno (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Grass, PokemonType.Dark, 1.0f, 28.0f);
		Add(entries, 275, "Shiftry", "Wicked", "It is said to arrive on chilly, wintry winds. Feared from long ago as the guardian of forests, this Pokémon lives in a deep forest where people do not venture.", "Bosque Secreto Noturno, Esgotos & Pantanal da Bruxa", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Noite Nebulosa, Chuva ou Céu Limpo", "Noturno (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Grass, PokemonType.Dark, 1.3f, 59.6f);
		Add(entries, 276, "Taillow", "Tiny Swallow", "Although it is small, it is very courageous. It will take on a larger Skarmory on an equal footing. However, its will weakens if it becomes hungry.", "Fazenda, Vila Pelicanos & Floresta Cinzenta", "Primavera, Verão & Outono", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, PokemonType.Flying, 0.3f, 2.3f);
		Add(entries, 277, "Swellow", "Swallow", "A Swellow dives upon prey from far above. It never misses its targets. It takes to the skies in search of lands with a warm climate.", "Montanha, Ponto de Ônibus & Ilha Gengibre", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, PokemonType.Flying, 0.7f, 19.8f);
		Add(entries, 278, "Wingull", "Seagull", "It makes its nest on a sheer cliff at the edge of the sea. It has trouble keeping its wings flapping in flight. Instead, it soars on updrafts.", "Ilha Gengibre (Costa Sul & Rio Tropical) & Praia", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, PokemonType.Flying, 0.6f, 9.5f);
		Add(entries, 279, "Pelipper", "Water Bird", "It skims the tops of waves as it flies. When it spots prey, it uses its large beak to scoop up the victim with water. It protects its eggs in its beak.", "Praia dos Pelicanos, Oceano & Ilha Gengibre (Praia Tropical)", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, PokemonType.Flying, 1.2f, 28.0f);
		Add(entries, 280, "Ralts", "Feeling", "A Ralts has the power to sense the emotions of people and Pokémon with the horns on its head. It takes cover if it senses any hostility.", "Ilha Gengibre (Selva Tropical) & Bosque Secreto", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Psychic, PokemonType.Fairy, 0.4f, 6.6f);
		Add(entries, 281, "Kirlia", "Emotion", "A Kirlia has the psychic power to create a rip in the dimensions and see into the future. It is said to dance with pleasure on sunny mornings.", "Arredores da Vila Pelicanos, Fazenda & Floresta", "Todas as Estações (Ano Inteiro)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Psychic, PokemonType.Fairy, 0.8f, 20.2f);
		Add(entries, 282, "Gardevoir", "Embrace", "It apparently does not feel the pull of gravity because it supports itself with psychic power. It will give its life to protect its Trainer.", "Floresta Cinzenta, Bosque Secreto & Fazenda", "Primavera & Verão", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Psychic, PokemonType.Fairy, 1.6f, 48.4f);
		Add(entries, 283, "Surskit", "Pond Skater", "They gather on puddles after evening downpours, gliding across the surface of water as if sliding. It secretes honey with a sweet aroma from its head.", "Rios da Floresta Cinzenta, Lago da Montanha & Ilha Tropical", "Outono & Inverno", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Bug, PokemonType.Water, 0.5f, 1.7f);
		Add(entries, 284, "Masquerain", "Eyeball", "It intimidates foes with the large eyelike patterns on its antennae. Because it can't fly if its wings get wet, it shelters itself from rain under large trees and eaves.", "Arredores da Vila Pelicanos, Fazenda & Floresta", "Primavera, Verão & Outono", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Bug, PokemonType.Flying, 0.8f, 3.6f);
		Add(entries, 285, "Shroomish", "Mushroom", "It loves to eat damp, composted soil in forests. If you enter a forest after a long rain, you can see many Shroomish feasting on composted soil.", "Floresta Cinzenta, Bosque Secreto & Fazenda", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Grass, null, 0.4f, 4.5f);
		Add(entries, 286, "Breloom", "Mushroom", "It scatters spores from holes in the cap on its head. It loves warm and humid climates. It feeds on trees and plants in fields and forests.", "Ilha Gengibre (Selva Tropical) & Bosque Secreto", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Grass, PokemonType.Fighting, 1.2f, 39.2f);
		Add(entries, 287, "Slakoth", "Slacker", "It sleeps virtually all day and night long. It doesn't change its nest its entire life, but it sometimes travels great distances by swimming in rivers.", "Deserto de Calico, Fazenda & Arredores da Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, null, 0.8f, 24.0f);
		Add(entries, 288, "Vigoroth", "Wild Monkey", "It can't keep still because its blood boils with energy. It runs through the fields and mountains all day to calm itself. If it doesn't, it can't sleep at night.", "Fazenda, Vila Pelicanos & Floresta Cinzenta", "Primavera, Verão & Outono", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, null, 1.4f, 46.5f);
		Add(entries, 289, "Slaking", "Lazy", "Hordes of Slaking gather around trees when fruits come into season. They wait around patiently for ripened fruits to fall out of the trees.", "Montanha, Ponto de Ônibus & Ilha Gengibre", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, null, 2.0f, 130.5f);
		Add(entries, 290, "Nincada", "Trainee", "It makes its nest at the roots of a mighty tree. Using its whiskerlike antennae, it probes its surroundings in the pitch-black darkness of soil.", "Caverna da Caveira, Deserto de Calico & Vulcão", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Bug, PokemonType.Ground, 0.5f, 5.5f);
		Add(entries, 291, "Ninjask", "Ninja", "Because it darts about vigorously at high speed, it is very difficult to see. Hearing its distinctive cries for too long induces a headache.", "Floresta Cinzenta, Bosque Secreto & Fazenda", "Outono & Inverno", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Bug, PokemonType.Flying, 0.8f, 12.0f);
		Add(entries, 292, "Shedinja", "Shed", "A peculiar Pokémon that floats in air even though its wings remain completely still. The inside of its body is hollow and utterly dark.", "Minas Profundas (80-120), Caverna da Caveira & Cemitério", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Noite Nebulosa, Chuva ou Céu Limpo", "Noturno (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Bug, PokemonType.Ghost, 0.8f, 1.2f);
		Add(entries, 293, "Whismur", "Whisper", "Its cries equal a jet plane in volume. It inhales through its ear canals. Because of this system, it can cry continually without having to catch its breath.", "Deserto de Calico, Fazenda & Arredores da Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, null, 0.6f, 16.3f);
		Add(entries, 294, "Loudred", "Big Voice", "It positions the round speakers on its head to assail foes with ultrasonic waves at massive volume. It builds power by stomping the ground.", "Fazenda, Vila Pelicanos & Floresta Cinzenta", "Primavera & Verão", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, null, 1.0f, 40.5f);
		Add(entries, 295, "Exploud", "Loud Noise", "It has sound-generating organs all over its body. It communicates with others by adjusting the tone and volume of the cries it emits.", "Montanha, Ponto de Ônibus & Ilha Gengibre", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, null, 1.5f, 84.0f);
		Add(entries, 296, "Makuhita", "Guts", "It loves to toughen up its body above all else. If you hear quaking rumbles in a cave, it is the sound of Makuhita undertaking strenuous training.", "Deserto de Calico, Fazenda & Arredores da Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Fighting, null, 1.0f, 86.4f);
		Add(entries, 297, "Hariyama", "Arm Thrust", "It has the habit of challenging others without hesitation to tests of strength. It's been known to stand on train tracks and stop trains using forearm thrusts.", "Fazenda, Vila Pelicanos & Floresta Cinzenta", "Todas as Estações (Ano Inteiro)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Fighting, null, 2.3f, 253.8f);
		Add(entries, 298, "Azurill", "Polka Dot", "Its tail, which is packed with nutrition, is very bouncy like a rubber ball. On sunny days they gather at the edge of water and splash about for fun.", "Ilha Gengibre (Selva Tropical) & Bosque Secreto", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, PokemonType.Fairy, 0.2f, 2.0f);
		Add(entries, 299, "Nosepass", "Compass", "Its body emits a powerful magnetism. It feeds on prey that is pulled in by the force. Its magnetism is stronger in cold seasons.", "Caverna da Caveira, Deserto de Calico & Vulcão", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Rock, null, 1.0f, 97.0f);
		Add(entries, 300, "Skitty", "Kitten", "A Skitty's adorably cute behavior makes it highly popular. In battle, it makes its tail puff out. It threatens foes with a sharp growl.", "Fazenda, Vila Pelicanos & Floresta Cinzenta", "Primavera, Verão & Outono", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, null, 0.6f, 11.0f);
		Add(entries, 301, "Delcatty", "Prim", "Rather than keeping a permanent lair, it habitually seeks comfortable spots and sleeps there. It is nocturnal and becomes active at dusk.", "Montanha, Ponto de Ônibus & Ilha Gengibre", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, null, 1.1f, 32.6f);
		Add(entries, 302, "Sableye", "Darkness", "It digs branching holes in caves using its sharp claws in search of food--raw gems. A Sableye lurks in darkness and is seen only rarely.", "Bosque Secreto Noturno, Esgotos & Pantanal da Bruxa", "Primavera & Verão", "Noite Nebulosa, Chuva ou Céu Limpo", "Noturno (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Dark, PokemonType.Ghost, 0.5f, 11.0f);
		Add(entries, 303, "Mawile", "Deceiver", "Its giant jaws are actually steel horns that transformed. It fools foes into complacency with its adorable gestures, then chomps them with its huge jaws.", "Deserto de Calico, Pedreira & Caverna da Caveira", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Steel, PokemonType.Fairy, 0.6f, 11.5f);
		Add(entries, 304, "Aron", "Iron Armor", "A Pokémon that is clad in steel armor. A new suit of armor is made when it evolves. The old, discarded armor is salvaged as metal for making iron products.", "Minas da Montanha (1-39), Pedreira & Deserto", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Steel, PokemonType.Rock, 0.4f, 60.0f);
		Add(entries, 305, "Lairon", "Iron Armor", "When two Lairon meet in the wild, they fight for territory by bashing into each other with their steel bodies. The sound of their collision carries for miles.", "Caverna da Caveira, Deserto de Calico & Vulcão", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Steel, PokemonType.Rock, 0.9f, 120.0f);
		Add(entries, 306, "Aggron", "Iron Armor", "Its iron horns grow longer a little at a time. They are used to determine the Aggron's age. The gouges in its armor are worn with pride as mementos from battles.", "Deserto de Calico, Pedreira & Caverna da Caveira", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Steel, PokemonType.Rock, 2.1f, 360.0f);
		Add(entries, 307, "Meditite", "Meditate", "It continually meditates for hours every day. As a result of rigorous and dedicated yoga training, it has tempered its spiritual power so much it can fly.", "Ilha Gengibre (Ruínas Tropicais), Ferrovia & Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Fighting, PokemonType.Psychic, 0.6f, 11.2f);
		Add(entries, 308, "Medicham", "Meditate", "Through crushingly harsh yoga training, it gained the power to foretell its foe's actions. It battles with elegant, dance- like movement.", "Montanha, Ferrovia, Torre do Mago & Deserto de Calico", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Fighting, PokemonType.Psychic, 1.3f, 31.5f);
		Add(entries, 309, "Electrike", "Lightning", "It generates electricity using friction from the atmosphere. In seasons with especially arid air, its entire body blazes with violent showers of sparks.", "Ilha Gengibre (Ruínas Tropicais), Ferrovia & Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Tempestade de Raios ou Chuva", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Electric, null, 0.6f, 15.2f);
		Add(entries, 310, "Manectric", "Discharge", "Because lightning falls in their vicinities, Manectric were thought to have been born from lightning. In battle, they create thunderclouds.", "Montanha, Ferrovia, Torre do Mago & Deserto de Calico", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Tempestade de Raios ou Chuva", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Electric, null, 1.5f, 40.2f);
		Add(entries, 311, "Plusle", "Cheering", "It has the trait of cheering on its fellow Pokémon. By shorting out the electricity it releases from its paws, it creates pom-poms for cheering.", "Ilha Gengibre (Ruínas Tropicais), Ferrovia & Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Tempestade de Raios ou Chuva", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Electric, null, 0.4f, 4.2f);
		Add(entries, 312, "Minun", "Cheering", "At a meeting of Pokémon academics, it was announced that simultaneous exposure to electricity from a Plusle and Minun will promote circulation and boost vitality.", "Montanha, Ferrovia, Torre do Mago & Deserto de Calico", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Tempestade de Raios ou Chuva", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Electric, null, 0.4f, 4.2f);
		Add(entries, 313, "Volbeat", "Firefly", "With their taillights lit, Volbeat fly in a swarm, drawing geometric designs in the night sky. They move their nests if their pond water becomes dirty.", "Ilha Gengibre (Selva Tropical) & Bosque Secreto", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Bug, null, 0.7f, 17.7f);
		Add(entries, 314, "Illumise", "Firefly", "A nocturnal Pokémon that becomes active upon nightfall. It leads a Volbeat swarm to draw patterns in the night sky. Over 200 different patterns have been confirmed.", "Arredores da Vila Pelicanos, Fazenda & Floresta", "Primavera & Verão", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Bug, null, 0.6f, 17.7f);
		Add(entries, 315, "Roselia", "Thorn", "A Roselia that drinks nutritionally rich springwater blooms with lovely flowers. The fragrance of its flowers has the effect of making its foes careless.", "Esgotos dos Pelicanos, Covil dos Insetos & Bosque Secreto", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Grass, PokemonType.Poison, 0.3f, 2.0f);
		Add(entries, 316, "Gulpin", "Stomach", "This Pokémon's stomach fluid can even digest scrap iron. In one gulp, it can swallow something that is as large as itself.", "Minas Profundas (80-120), Caverna da Caveira & Cemitério", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Poison, null, 0.4f, 10.3f);
		Add(entries, 317, "Swalot", "Poison Bag", "Its powerful stomach acid is capable of digesting almost anything. The one thing in the whole world a Swalot can't digest is its own stomach.", "Bosque Secreto Noturno, Esgotos & Pantanal da Bruxa", "Todas as Estações (Ano Inteiro)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Poison, null, 1.7f, 80.0f);
		Add(entries, 318, "Carvanha", "Savage", "Carvanha attack ships in swarms, making them sink. Although it is said to be a very vicious Pokémon, it timidly flees as soon as it finds itself alone.", "Praia dos Pelicanos, Oceano & Ilha Gengibre (Praia Tropical)", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Noturno (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, PokemonType.Dark, 0.8f, 20.8f);
		Add(entries, 319, "Sharpedo", "Brutal", "The vicious and sly gangster of the sea. Its skin is specially textured to minimize drag in water. Its speed tops out at over 75 miles per hour.", "Rios da Floresta Cinzenta, Lago da Montanha & Ilha Tropical", "Outono & Inverno", "Noite Nebulosa, Chuva ou Céu Limpo", "Noturno (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, PokemonType.Dark, 1.8f, 88.8f);
		Add(entries, 320, "Wailmer", "Ball Whale", "While this Pokémon usually lives in the sea, it can survive on land, although not too long. It loses vitality if its body becomes dried out.", "Ilha Gengibre (Costa Sul & Rio Tropical) & Praia", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, null, 2.0f, 130.0f);
		Add(entries, 321, "Wailord", "Float Whale", "It breathes through nostrils that it raises above the sea. By inhaling to its maximum capacity, a Wailord can dive close to 10,000 feet beneath the waves.", "Praia dos Pelicanos, Oceano & Ilha Gengibre (Praia Tropical)", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, null, 14.5f, 398.0f);
		Add(entries, 322, "Numel", "Numb", "A Numel stores boiling magma in the hump on its back. It is a hardy Pokémon that can transport a 220-pound load. It has served humans at work since long ago.", "Deserto de Calico & Encostas do Vulcão da Ilha", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Fire, PokemonType.Ground, 0.7f, 24.0f);
		Add(entries, 323, "Camerupt", "Eruption", "A Pokémon that lives in the crater of a volcano. Every 10 years, the volcanoes on its back erupt violently. Research is under way on the cause of eruption.", "Caverna da Caveira & Forja do Vulcão", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Fire, PokemonType.Ground, 1.9f, 220.0f);
		Add(entries, 324, "Torkoal", "Coal", "It battles using energy it gets from burning coal. When loosing smoke from its nostrils, it lets off a sound that is similar to a locomotive's horn.", "Vulcão da Ilha Gengibre & Minas de Lava (80-120)", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Fire, null, 0.5f, 80.4f);
		Add(entries, 325, "Spoink", "Bounce", "A Pokémon that manipulates psychic power at will. It doesn't stop bouncing even when it is asleep. It loves eating mushrooms that grow underground.", "Ilha Gengibre (Ruínas Tropicais), Ferrovia & Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Psychic, null, 0.7f, 30.6f);
		Add(entries, 326, "Grumpig", "Manipulate", "It stores power in the black pearls on its forehead. When it uses psychic power, it performs an odd dance step. Its style of dancing became hugely popular overseas.", "Montanha, Ferrovia, Torre do Mago & Deserto de Calico", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Psychic, null, 0.9f, 71.5f);
		Add(entries, 327, "Spinda", "Spot Panda", "It is distinguished by a pattern of spots that is always different. Its unsteady, tottering walk has the effect of fouling its foe's aim.", "Fazenda, Vila Pelicanos & Floresta Cinzenta", "Outono & Inverno", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, null, 1.1f, 5.0f);
		Add(entries, 328, "Trapinch", "Ant Pit", "Its big jaws crunch through boulders. Because its head is so big, it has a hard time getting back upright if it tips over onto its back.", "Minas da Montanha (1-39), Pedreira & Deserto", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Ground, null, 0.7f, 15.0f);
		Add(entries, 329, "Vibrava", "Vibration", "It looses ultrasonic waves by rubbing its wings together. Since a Vibrava's wings are still in the process of growing, it can only fly short distances.", "Caverna da Caveira, Deserto de Calico & Vulcão", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Ground, PokemonType.Dragon, 1.1f, 15.3f);
		Add(entries, 330, "Flygon", "Mystic", "The flapping of its wings sounds like singing. To prevent detection by enemies, it hides itself by flapping up a cloud of desert sand.", "Deserto de Calico, Pedreira & Caverna da Caveira", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Ground, PokemonType.Dragon, 2.0f, 82.0f);
		Add(entries, 331, "Cacnea", "Cactus", "Cacnea live in deserts with virtually no rainfall. It battles by swinging its thick, spiked arms. Once a year, a yellow flower blooms.", "Ilha Gengibre (Selva Tropical) & Bosque Secreto", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Grass, null, 0.4f, 51.3f);
		Add(entries, 332, "Cacturne", "Scarecrow", "After spending thousands of years in harsh deserts, its blood transformed into the same substances as sand. It is nocturnal, so it hunts at night.", "Bosque Secreto Noturno, Esgotos & Pantanal da Bruxa", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Noite Nebulosa, Chuva ou Céu Limpo", "Noturno (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Grass, PokemonType.Dark, 1.3f, 77.4f);
		Add(entries, 333, "Swablu", "Cotton Bird", "A Pokémon that has wings like cottony clouds. After enduring winter, in which little food is available, Swablu flocks move closer to towns in the spring.", "Fazenda, Vila Pelicanos & Floresta Cinzenta", "Todas as Estações (Ano Inteiro)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, PokemonType.Flying, 0.4f, 1.2f);
		Add(entries, 334, "Altaria", "Humming", "It hums in a beautiful soprano voice. It flies among white clouds in the blue sky. It launches intensely hot fireballs from its mouth.", "Caverna da Caveira, Vulcão da Ilha & Cume da Montanha", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Dragon, PokemonType.Flying, 1.1f, 20.6f);
		Add(entries, 335, "Zangoose", "Cat Ferret", "When it battles, it stands on its hind legs and attacks with its sharply clawed forelegs. Its fur bristles if it encounters any Seviper.", "Deserto de Calico, Fazenda & Arredores da Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, null, 1.3f, 40.3f);
		Add(entries, 336, "Seviper", "Fang Snake", "Seviper and Zangoose are eternal rivals. It counters a Zangoose's dazzling agility with its swordlike tail, which also oozes a horrible poison.", "Esgotos dos Pelicanos, Covil dos Insetos & Bosque Secreto", "Primavera, Verão & Outono", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Poison, null, 2.7f, 52.5f);
		Add(entries, 337, "Lunatone", "Meteorite", "It becomes very active on the night of a full moon. This Pokémon was first discovered 40 years ago at the site of a meteor strike.", "Minas da Montanha (1-39), Pedreira & Deserto", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Rock, PokemonType.Psychic, 1.0f, 168.0f);
		Add(entries, 338, "Solrock", "Meteorite", "Solar energy is the source of this Pokémon's power. On sunny days, groups of Solrock line up facing the sun and absorb its light.", "Caverna da Caveira, Deserto de Calico & Vulcão", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Rock, PokemonType.Psychic, 1.2f, 154.0f);
		Add(entries, 339, "Barboach", "Whiskers", "Its body is covered with a slimy film. The film acts as a barrier to prevent germs in muddy water from entering the Barboach's body.", "Deserto de Calico, Pedreira & Caverna da Caveira", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, PokemonType.Ground, 0.4f, 1.9f);
		Add(entries, 340, "Whiscash", "Whiskers", "Mysteriously, it can foretell earthquakes. In the daytime, it sleeps in mud at the bottom of a pond. When it awakens, it continually feeds throughout the night.", "Minas da Montanha (1-39), Pedreira & Deserto", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, PokemonType.Ground, 0.9f, 23.6f);
		Add(entries, 341, "Corphish", "Ruffian", "Once it grips prey with its large pincers, it will never let go, no matter what. It is a hardy Pokémon that can thrive in any environment.", "Ilha Gengibre (Costa Sul & Rio Tropical) & Praia", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, null, 0.6f, 11.5f);
		Add(entries, 342, "Crawdaunt", "Rogue", "A brutish Pokémon that loves to battle. A veteran Crawdaunt that has prevailed in hundreds of battles has giant pincers marked with countless scars.", "Praia dos Pelicanos, Oceano & Ilha Gengibre (Praia Tropical)", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Noturno (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, PokemonType.Dark, 1.1f, 32.8f);
		Add(entries, 343, "Baltoy", "Clay Doll", "A Baltoy moves by spinning on its single foot. It has been depicted in murals adorning the walls of a once-bustling city in an ancient age.", "Minas da Montanha (1-39), Pedreira & Deserto", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Ground, PokemonType.Psychic, 0.5f, 21.5f);
		Add(entries, 344, "Claydol", "Clay Doll", "A Claydol sleeps while hovering in midair. Its arms are separate from its body. They are kept floating by the Pokémon's manipulation of psychic power.", "Caverna da Caveira, Deserto de Calico & Vulcão", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Ground, PokemonType.Psychic, 1.5f, 108.0f);
		Add(entries, 345, "Lileep", "Sea Lily", "It disguises itself as seaweed by making its tentacles sway. Unsuspecting prey that come too close are swallowed whole. It became extinct 100 million years ago.", "Deserto de Calico, Pedreira & Caverna da Caveira", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Rock, PokemonType.Grass, 1.0f, 23.8f);
		Add(entries, 346, "Cradily", "Barnacle", "It drags its heavy body along the seafloor. It makes its nest in the shallows of warm seas. Cradily can be seen on beaches when the tide goes out.", "Minas da Montanha (1-39), Pedreira & Deserto", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Rock, PokemonType.Grass, 1.5f, 60.4f);
		Add(entries, 347, "Anorith", "Old Shrimp", "It was resurrected from a fossil using the power of science. It swims by undulating the eight wings at its sides. They were feet that adapted to life in the sea.", "Caverna da Caveira, Deserto de Calico & Vulcão", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Rock, PokemonType.Bug, 0.7f, 12.5f);
		Add(entries, 348, "Armaldo", "Plate", "Armaldo usually lives on land. However, when it hunts for prey, it dives beneath the ocean. It swims around using its two large wings.", "Deserto de Calico, Pedreira & Caverna da Caveira", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Rock, PokemonType.Bug, 1.5f, 68.2f);
		Add(entries, 349, "Feebas", "Fish", "Feebas live in ponds that are heavily infested with weeds. Because of its hopelessly shabby appearance, it seems as if few Trainers raise it.", "Rios da Floresta Cinzenta, Lago da Montanha & Ilha Tropical", "Todas as Estações (Ano Inteiro)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, null, 0.6f, 7.4f);
		Add(entries, 350, "Milotic", "Tender", "It is said to live at the bottom of large lakes. Considered to be the most beautiful of all Pokémon, it has been depicted in paintings and statues.", "Ilha Gengibre (Costa Sul & Rio Tropical) & Praia", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, null, 6.2f, 162.0f);
		Add(entries, 351, "Castform", "Weather", "It alters its form depending on the weather. Changes in the climate such as the temperature and humidity appear to affect its cellular structure.", "Fazenda, Vila Pelicanos & Floresta Cinzenta", "Outono & Inverno", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, null, 0.3f, 0.8f);
		Add(entries, 352, "Kecleon", "Color Swap", "A Pokémon that has the ability to alter its body colors to match its surroundings. A Kecleon reverts to its original colors if it is startled.", "Montanha, Ponto de Ônibus & Ilha Gengibre", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, null, 1.0f, 22.0f);
		Add(entries, 353, "Shuppet", "Puppet", "This Pokémon roams about deep in the night seeking such negative emotions as grudges and envy. It retreats to its nest when the sun begins to rise.", "Bosque Secreto Noturno, Esgotos & Pantanal da Bruxa", "Todas as Estações (Ano Inteiro)", "Noite Nebulosa, Chuva ou Céu Limpo", "Noturno (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Ghost, null, 0.6f, 2.3f);
		Add(entries, 354, "Banette", "Marionette", "An abandoned plush doll became this Pokémon. They are said to live in garbage dumps and wander about in search of the children that threw them away.", "Esgotos dos Pelicanos, Covil dos Insetos & Bosque Secreto", "Primavera & Verão", "Noite Nebulosa, Chuva ou Céu Limpo", "Noturno (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Ghost, null, 1.1f, 12.5f);
		Add(entries, 355, "Duskull", "Requiem", "A glare from its single scarlet eye makes even burly grown-ups freeze in utter fear. It is a nocturnal Pokémon that roams about under the cloak of darkness.", "Minas Profundas (80-120), Caverna da Caveira & Cemitério", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Noite Nebulosa, Chuva ou Céu Limpo", "Noturno (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Ghost, null, 0.8f, 15.0f);
		Add(entries, 356, "Dusclops", "Beckon", "It is thought that its body is hollow with only a spectral ball of fire burning inside. However, no one has been able to confirm this theory as fact.", "Bosque Secreto Noturno, Esgotos & Pantanal da Bruxa", "Primavera, Verão & Outono", "Noite Nebulosa, Chuva ou Céu Limpo", "Noturno (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Ghost, null, 1.6f, 30.6f);
		Add(entries, 357, "Tropius", "Fruit", "It flies by flapping its broad leaves. The bunch of fruit that grows around its neck is deliciously sweet. In the spring, it scatters pollen from its neck.", "Floresta Cinzenta, Bosque Secreto & Fazenda", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Grass, PokemonType.Flying, 2.0f, 100.0f);
		Add(entries, 358, "Chimecho", "Wind Chime", "They fly about very actively when the hot season arrives. They communicate among themselves using seven different and distinguishing cries.", "Montanha, Ferrovia, Torre do Mago & Deserto de Calico", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Psychic, null, 0.6f, 1.0f);
		Add(entries, 359, "Absol", "Disaster", "It sharply senses even subtle changes in the sky and the land to predict natural disasters. It is a long-lived Pokémon that has a life-span of 100 years.", "Bosque Secreto Noturno, Esgotos & Pantanal da Bruxa", "Outono & Inverno", "Noite Nebulosa, Chuva ou Céu Limpo", "Noturno (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Dark, null, 1.2f, 47.0f);
		Add(entries, 360, "Wynaut", "Bright", "A Wynaut loves to eat sweet fruits. It cleverly picks fruits using its earlike arms. They gather in fruit gardens, drawn by the fragrance.", "Montanha, Ferrovia, Torre do Mago & Deserto de Calico", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Psychic, null, 0.6f, 14.0f);
		Add(entries, 361, "Snorunt", "Snow Hat", "They tend to move about in groups of around five Snorunt. In snowy regions, it is said that when they are seen late at night, snowfall will arrive by morning.", "Pico da Montanha, Ferrovia & Floresta no Inverno", "Inverno (Qualquer estação nas Minas 40-79)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Ice, null, 0.7f, 16.8f);
		Add(entries, 362, "Glalie", "Face", "A Glalie has the power to instantaneously freeze moisture in the atmosphere. A dazzling cloud of diamondlike ice crystals forms around its body.", "Minas Congeladas (Andares 40-79) & Montanha no Inverno", "Inverno (Qualquer estação nas Minas 40-79)", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Ice, null, 1.5f, 256.5f);
		Add(entries, 363, "Spheal", "Clap", "It is completely covered with plushy fur. As a result, it never feels the cold even when it is rolling about on ice floes or diving in the sea.", "Pico da Montanha, Ferrovia & Floresta no Inverno", "Inverno (Qualquer estação nas Minas 40-79)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Ice, PokemonType.Water, 0.8f, 39.5f);
		Add(entries, 364, "Sealeo", "Ball Roll", "Sealeo live in herds on ice floes. Using its powerful flippers, it shatters ice. It dives into the sea to hunt prey five times a day.", "Minas Congeladas (Andares 40-79) & Montanha no Inverno", "Inverno (Qualquer estação nas Minas 40-79)", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Ice, PokemonType.Water, 1.1f, 87.6f);
		Add(entries, 365, "Walrein", "Ice Break", "To protect its herd, the leader battles anything that invades its territory, even at the cost of its life. Its tusks may snap off in battle.", "Pico da Montanha, Ferrovia & Floresta no Inverno", "Inverno (Qualquer estação nas Minas 40-79)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Ice, PokemonType.Water, 1.4f, 150.6f);
		Add(entries, 366, "Clamperl", "Bivalve", "A Clamperl slams its shell closed on prey to prevent escape. The pearl it creates upon evolution is said to be infused with a mysterious energy.", "Praia dos Pelicanos, Oceano & Ilha Gengibre (Praia Tropical)", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, null, 0.4f, 52.5f);
		Add(entries, 367, "Huntail", "Deep Sea", "To withstand the crushing pressure of water deep under the sea, its spine is very thick and sturdy. Its tail, which is shaped like a small fish, has eyes that light up.", "Rios da Floresta Cinzenta, Lago da Montanha & Ilha Tropical", "Outono & Inverno", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, null, 1.7f, 27.0f);
		Add(entries, 368, "Gorebyss", "South Sea", "A Gorebyss siphons the body fluids of prey through its thin, tubular mouth. Its light pink body color turns vivid when it finishes feeding.", "Ilha Gengibre (Costa Sul & Rio Tropical) & Praia", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, null, 1.8f, 22.6f);
		Add(entries, 369, "Relicanth", "Longevity", "A Pokémon that was once believed to have been extinct. The species has not changed its form for 100 million years. It walks on the seafloor using its pectoral fins.", "Deserto de Calico, Pedreira & Caverna da Caveira", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, PokemonType.Rock, 1.0f, 23.4f);
		Add(entries, 370, "Luvdisc", "Rendezvous", "Luvdisc make the branches of Corsola their nests. There is a custom from long ago of giving a Luvdisc as a gift to express one's feelings of love.", "Rios da Floresta Cinzenta, Lago da Montanha & Ilha Tropical", "Primavera & Verão", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, null, 0.6f, 8.7f);
		Add(entries, 371, "Bagon", "Rock Head", "Although it is small, this Pokémon is very powerful because its body is a bundle of muscles. It launches head-butts with its ironlike skull.", "Ilha Gengibre (Cratera do Vulcão) & Caverna dos Piratas", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Dragon, null, 0.6f, 42.1f);
		Add(entries, 372, "Shelgon", "Endurance", "It hardly eats while it awaits evolution. It becomes hardier by enduring hunger. Its shell peels off the instant it begins to evolve.", "Caverna da Caveira, Vulcão da Ilha & Cume da Montanha", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Dragon, null, 1.1f, 110.5f);
		Add(entries, 373, "Salamence", "Dragon", "After many long years, its cellular structure underwent a sudden mutation to grow wings. When angered, it loses all thought and rampages out of control.", "Ilha Gengibre (Cratera do Vulcão) & Caverna dos Piratas", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Dragon, PokemonType.Flying, 1.5f, 102.6f);
		Add(entries, 374, "Beldum", "Iron Ball", "When Beldum gather in a swarm, they move in perfect unison as if they were but one Pokémon. They communicate with each other using brain waves.", "Caverna da Caveira, Deserto de Calico & Vulcão", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Steel, PokemonType.Psychic, 0.6f, 95.2f);
		Add(entries, 375, "Metang", "Iron Claw", "The claws tipping its arms pack the destructive power to tear through thick iron sheets as if they were silk. It flies at over 60 miles per hour.", "Deserto de Calico, Pedreira & Caverna da Caveira", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Steel, PokemonType.Psychic, 1.2f, 202.5f);
		Add(entries, 376, "Metagross", "Iron Leg", "Metagross has four brains that are joined by a complex neural network. As a result of integration, this Pokémon is smarter than a supercomputer.", "Minas da Montanha (1-39), Pedreira & Deserto", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Steel, PokemonType.Psychic, 1.6f, 550.0f);
		Add(entries, 377, "Regirock", "Rock Peak", "A Pokémon that is made entirely of rocks and boulders. If parts of its body chip off in battle, Regirock repairs itself by adding new rocks.", "Cume do Vale (The Summit), Caverna da Caveira & Vulcão", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Meia-Noite (22:00h às 02:00h)", "Legendary", PokemonType.Rock, null, 1.7f, 230.0f);
		Add(entries, 378, "Regice", "Iceberg", "Its entire body is made of Antarctic ice. After extensive studies, researchers believe the ice was formed during an ice age.", "Ilha Gengibre (Recife Oeste) & Profundezas Oceânicas", "Inverno (Qualquer estação nas Minas 40-79)", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Crepúsculo & Noite Profunda (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Legendary", PokemonType.Ice, null, 1.8f, 175.0f);
		Add(entries, 379, "Registeel", "Iron", "Its body is harder than any other kind of metal. The body metal is composed of a mysterious substance. Not only is it hard, it shrinks and stretches flexibly.", "Cume do Vale (The Summit), Caverna da Caveira & Vulcão", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Amanhecer Dourado (06:00h às 10:00h)", "Legendary", PokemonType.Steel, null, 1.9f, 205.0f);
		Add(entries, 380, "Latias", "Eon", "They make a small herd of only several members. They rarely make contact with people or other Pokémon. They disappear if they sense enemies.", "Bosque Secreto, Santuário da Ilha & Cume do Vale", "Primavera, Verão & Outono", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Meia-Noite (22:00h às 02:00h)", "Legendary", PokemonType.Dragon, PokemonType.Psychic, 1.4f, 40.0f);
		Add(entries, 381, "Latios", "Eon", "Even in hiding, it can detect the locations of others and sense their emotions since it has telepathy. Its intelligence allows it to understand human languages.", "Vulcão da Ilha Gengibre (Caldeira) & Caverna da Caveira", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Crepúsculo & Noite Profunda (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Legendary", PokemonType.Dragon, PokemonType.Psychic, 2.0f, 60.0f);
		Add(entries, 382, "Kyogre", "Sea Basin", "Kyogre has appeared in mythology as the creator of the sea. After long years of feuding with Groudon, it took to sleep at the bottom of the sea.", "Ilha Gengibre (Recife Oeste) & Profundezas Oceânicas", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Amanhecer Dourado (06:00h às 10:00h)", "Legendary", PokemonType.Water, null, 4.5f, 352.0f);
		Add(entries, 383, "Groudon", "Continent", "Groudon has appeared in mythology as the creator of the land. It sleeps in magma underground and is said to make volcanoes erupt on awakening.", "Cume do Vale (The Summit), Caverna da Caveira & Vulcão", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Meia-Noite (22:00h às 02:00h)", "Legendary", PokemonType.Ground, null, 3.5f, 950.0f);
		Add(entries, 384, "Rayquaza", "Sky High", "A Pokémon that flies endlessly in the ozone layer. It is said it would descend to the ground if Kyogre and Groudon were to fight.", "Vulcão da Ilha Gengibre (Caldeira) & Caverna da Caveira", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Crepúsculo & Noite Profunda (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Legendary", PokemonType.Dragon, PokemonType.Flying, 7.0f, 206.5f);
		Add(entries, 385, "Jirachi", "Wish", "Jirachi is said to make wishes come true. While it sleeps, a tough crystalline shell envelops the body to protect it from enemies.", "Bosque Secreto, Santuário da Ilha & Cume do Vale", "Todas as Estações (Ano Inteiro)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Amanhecer Dourado (06:00h às 10:00h)", "Mythical", PokemonType.Steel, PokemonType.Psychic, 0.3f, 1.1f);
		Add(entries, 386, "Deoxys", "DNA", "Deoxys emerged from a virus that came from space. It is highly intelligent and can shoot lasers from the crystalline organ on its chest.", "Bosque Secreto, Santuário da Ilha & Cume do Vale", "Primavera & Verão", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Meia-Noite (22:00h às 02:00h)", "Mythical", PokemonType.Psychic, null, 1.7f, 60.8f);
		Add(entries, 387, "Turtwig", "Tiny Leaf", "The shell on its back is made of soil. On a very healthy Turtwig, the shell should feel moist. The leaf on its head wilts if it is thirsty.", "Floresta Cinzenta, Bosque Secreto & Fazenda", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Starter", PokemonType.Grass, null, 0.4f, 10.2f);
		Add(entries, 388, "Grotle", "Grove", "A Grotle that lives in the forest is said to have its own secret springwater well. It carries fellow Pokémon there on its back.", "Ilha Gengibre (Selva Tropical) & Bosque Secreto", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Starter", PokemonType.Grass, null, 1.1f, 97.0f);
		Add(entries, 389, "Torterra", "Continent", "Some Pokémon are born on a Torterra's back and spend their entire life there. Ancient people imagined that beneath the ground, a gigantic Torterra dwelled.", "Caverna da Caveira, Deserto de Calico & Vulcão", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Starter", PokemonType.Grass, PokemonType.Ground, 2.2f, 310.0f);
		Add(entries, 390, "Chimchar", "Chimp", "Its fiery rear end is fueled by gas made in its belly. Before going to sleep, Chimchar extinguish the flame on their tails to prevent fires.", "Vulcão da Ilha Gengibre & Minas de Lava (80-120)", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Starter", PokemonType.Fire, null, 0.5f, 6.2f);
		Add(entries, 391, "Monferno", "Playful", "It carefully controls the intensity of the flame on its tail, so as to keep its foes at an adequate distance. Its fiery tail is but one weapon.", "Deserto de Calico & Encostas do Vulcão da Ilha", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Starter", PokemonType.Fire, PokemonType.Fighting, 0.9f, 22.0f);
		Add(entries, 392, "Infernape", "Flame", "Its crown of fire is indicative of its fiery nature. It uses a special kind of martial arts involving all of its limbs to take on any opponent.", "Caverna da Caveira & Forja do Vulcão", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Starter", PokemonType.Fire, PokemonType.Fighting, 1.2f, 55.0f);
		Add(entries, 393, "Piplup", "Penguin", "A poor walker, it often falls down. However, its strong pride makes it puff up its chest without a care. It's difficult to bond with since it won't listen to its Trainer.", "Praia dos Pelicanos, Oceano & Ilha Gengibre (Praia Tropical)", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Starter", PokemonType.Water, null, 0.4f, 5.2f);
		Add(entries, 394, "Prinplup", "Penguin", "Because every Prinplup considers itself to be the most important, they can never form a group. It searches for prey in icy seas.", "Rios da Floresta Cinzenta, Lago da Montanha & Ilha Tropical", "Primavera & Verão", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Starter", PokemonType.Water, null, 0.8f, 23.0f);
		Add(entries, 395, "Empoleon", "Emperor", "The three horns that extend from its beak attest to its power. It avoids unnecessary disputes, but it will decimate anything that threatens its pride.", "Caverna da Caveira, Deserto de Calico & Vulcão", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Starter", PokemonType.Water, PokemonType.Steel, 1.7f, 84.5f);
		Add(entries, 396, "Starly", "Starling", "They flock around mountains and fields, chasing after bug Pokémon. However, they bicker if the group grows too big. Their singing is noisy and annoying.", "Fazenda, Vila Pelicanos & Floresta Cinzenta", "Primavera, Verão & Outono", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, PokemonType.Flying, 0.3f, 2.0f);
		Add(entries, 397, "Staravia", "Starling", "Recognizing their own weakness, they maintain huge flocks. Fierce scuffles break out between various flocks. When alone, a Staravia cries noisily.", "Montanha, Ponto de Ônibus & Ilha Gengibre", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, PokemonType.Flying, 0.6f, 15.5f);
		Add(entries, 398, "Staraptor", "Predator", "When Staravia evolve into Staraptor, they leave the flock to live alone. It has a savage nature. It will courageously challenge foes that are much larger.", "Deserto de Calico, Fazenda & Arredores da Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, PokemonType.Flying, 1.2f, 24.9f);
		Add(entries, 399, "Bidoof", "Plump Mouse", "A comparison revealed that Bidoof's front teeth grow at the same rate as Rattata's. It constantly gnaws on logs and rocks to whittle down its front teeth.", "Fazenda, Vila Pelicanos & Floresta Cinzenta", "Outono & Inverno", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, null, 0.5f, 20.0f);
		Add(entries, 400, "Bibarel", "Beaver", "It makes its nest by damming streams with bark and mud. A river dammed by Bibarel will never overflow its banks, which is appreciated by people nearby.", "Rios da Floresta Cinzenta, Lago da Montanha & Ilha Tropical", "Primavera, Verão & Outono", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, PokemonType.Water, 1.0f, 31.5f);
		Add(entries, 401, "Kricketot", "Cricket", "It shakes its head back to front, causing its antennae to hit each other and sound like a xylophone. These sounds are fall hallmarks.", "Arredores da Vila Pelicanos, Fazenda & Floresta", "Todas as Estações (Ano Inteiro)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Bug, null, 0.3f, 2.2f);
		Add(entries, 402, "Kricketune", "Cricket", "It signals its emotions with its melodies. There is a village that hosts a contest based on the amazingly variable cries of this Pokémon.", "Floresta Cinzenta, Bosque Secreto & Fazenda", "Primavera & Verão", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Bug, null, 1.0f, 25.5f);
		Add(entries, 403, "Shinx", "Flash", "It rapidly contracts and relaxes its muscles to generate electricity. Its body shines if endangered. It flees while the foe is momentarily blinded.", "Ilha Gengibre (Ruínas Tropicais), Ferrovia & Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Tempestade de Raios ou Chuva", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Electric, null, 0.5f, 9.5f);
		Add(entries, 404, "Luxio", "Spark", "Strong electricity courses through the tips of its sharp claws. A light scratch has enough amperage to cause fainting in foes.", "Montanha, Ferrovia, Torre do Mago & Deserto de Calico", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Tempestade de Raios ou Chuva", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Electric, null, 0.9f, 30.5f);
		Add(entries, 405, "Luxray", "Gleam Eyes", "It has eyes which can see through anything. Luxray's ability to see through objects comes in handy when it's scouting for danger.", "Ilha Gengibre (Ruínas Tropicais), Ferrovia & Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Tempestade de Raios ou Chuva", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Electric, null, 1.4f, 42.0f);
		Add(entries, 406, "Budew", "Bud", "Over the winter, it closes its bud and endures the cold. Sensitive to changing temperature, the bud is said to bloom when it feels the sun's warm touch.", "Minas Profundas (80-120), Caverna da Caveira & Cemitério", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Grass, PokemonType.Poison, 0.2f, 1.2f);
		Add(entries, 407, "Roserade", "Bouquet", "Its sweet aroma attracts prey. With the movements of a dancer, it strikes with whips that are densely lined with poison thorns.", "Bosque Secreto Noturno, Esgotos & Pantanal da Bruxa", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Grass, PokemonType.Poison, 0.9f, 14.5f);
		Add(entries, 408, "Cranidos", "Head Butt", "A lifelong jungle dweller from 100 million years ago, its skull is as hard as iron. It would snap obstructing trees with headbutts.", "Deserto de Calico, Pedreira & Caverna da Caveira", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Rock, null, 0.9f, 31.5f);
		Add(entries, 409, "Rampardos", "Head Butt", "The result of repeated headbutts is a skull grown thick and hard. However, its brain has shrunk in size compared with Cranidos's.", "Minas da Montanha (1-39), Pedreira & Deserto", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Rock, null, 1.6f, 102.5f);
		Add(entries, 410, "Shieldon", "Shield", "This Pokémon lived in primeval jungles. Few enemies would have been willing to square off against its heavily armored face, so it's thought.", "Caverna da Caveira, Deserto de Calico & Vulcão", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Rock, PokemonType.Steel, 0.5f, 57.0f);
		Add(entries, 411, "Bastiodon", "Shield", "Their rock-hard faces serve to protect them from any frontral attacks. When attacked, they form a wall. They shielded their young in that way.", "Deserto de Calico, Pedreira & Caverna da Caveira", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Rock, PokemonType.Steel, 1.3f, 149.5f);
		Add(entries, 412, "Burmy", "Bagworm", "If its cloak is even slightly damaged, it will immediately repair it with whatever is near at hand. The Pokémon within the cloak is scrawny and vulnerable to the cold.", "Ilha Gengibre (Selva Tropical) & Bosque Secreto", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Bug, null, 0.2f, 3.4f);
		Add(entries, 413, "Wormadam", "Bagworm", "Its appearance changes depending on where Burmy evolved. The materials on hand become a part of its body. The cloak is never shed.", "Arredores da Vila Pelicanos, Fazenda & Floresta", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Bug, PokemonType.Grass, 0.5f, 6.5f);
		Add(entries, 414, "Mothim", "Espécie", "Mothim habita os ecossistemas naturais da região e possui habilidades únicas.", "Floresta Cinzenta, Bosque Secreto & Fazenda", "Primavera & Verão", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Bug, PokemonType.Flying, 1.0f, 20.0f);
		Add(entries, 415, "Combee", "Tiny Bee", "A Pokémon formed by three others. It constantly gathers honey from flowers to please Vespiquen. At night, they cluster to form a beehive and sleep.", "Ilha Gengibre (Selva Tropical) & Bosque Secreto", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Bug, PokemonType.Flying, 0.3f, 5.5f);
		Add(entries, 416, "Vespiquen", "Beehive", "It houses its colony in cells in its body and releases various pheromones to make those grubs do its bidding. There is only one in a colony.", "Arredores da Vila Pelicanos, Fazenda & Floresta", "Primavera, Verão & Outono", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Bug, PokemonType.Flying, 1.2f, 38.5f);
		Add(entries, 417, "Pachirisu", "EleSquirrel", "A pair may be seen rubbing their cheek pouches together in an effort to share stored electricity. It stores them with berries in tree holes.", "Ilha Gengibre (Ruínas Tropicais), Ferrovia & Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Tempestade de Raios ou Chuva", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Electric, null, 0.4f, 3.9f);
		Add(entries, 418, "Buizel", "Sea Weasel", "It inflates its flotation sac, keeping its face above water in order to watch for prey movement. It swims by rotating its two tails like a screw.", "Rios da Floresta Cinzenta, Lago da Montanha & Ilha Tropical", "Primavera & Verão", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, null, 0.7f, 29.5f);
		Add(entries, 419, "Floatzel", "Sea Weasel", "Its flotation sac developed as a result of pursuing aquatic prey. It can double as a rubber raft. It assists in the rescues of drowning people.", "Ilha Gengibre (Costa Sul & Rio Tropical) & Praia", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, null, 1.1f, 33.5f);
		Add(entries, 420, "Cherubi", "Cherry", "The small ball holds the nutrients needed for evolution. Apparently, it is also very sweet and tasty. Pokémon like Starly and Taillow try to peck it off.", "Floresta Cinzenta, Bosque Secreto & Fazenda", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Grass, null, 0.4f, 3.3f);
		Add(entries, 421, "Cherrim", "Blossom", "It's motionless, save for the occasional quiver. A rich array of Pokémon can be found gathered around it, drawn by the scent exuded from Cherrim's folded petals.", "Ilha Gengibre (Selva Tropical) & Bosque Secreto", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Grass, null, 0.5f, 9.3f);
		Add(entries, 422, "Shellos", "Sea Slug", "It oozes a purple fluid to deter enemies. While harmless, the fluid is awfully sticky. Apparently, there are more West Sea Shellos now than there were in the past.", "Ilha Gengibre (Costa Sul & Rio Tropical) & Praia", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, null, 0.3f, 6.3f);
		Add(entries, 423, "Gastrodon", "Sea Slug", "It appears on shallow-water beaches to eat sand for nourishment. Should one Gastrodon encounter another of a different color, a fierce battle will ensue.", "Deserto de Calico, Pedreira & Caverna da Caveira", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, PokemonType.Ground, 0.9f, 29.9f);
		Add(entries, 424, "Ambipom", "Long Tail", "They live on large trees. Split into two, the tails are so adept at handling and doing things, Ambipom rarely uses its hands now.", "Montanha, Ponto de Ônibus & Ilha Gengibre", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, null, 1.2f, 20.3f);
		Add(entries, 425, "Drifloon", "Balloon", "Because of the way it floats aimlessly, an old folktale calls it a “Signpost for Wandering Spirits.” Children holding them sometimes vanish.", "Bosque Secreto Noturno, Esgotos & Pantanal da Bruxa", "Todas as Estações (Ano Inteiro)", "Noite Nebulosa, Chuva ou Céu Limpo", "Noturno (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Ghost, PokemonType.Flying, 0.4f, 1.2f);
		Add(entries, 426, "Drifblim", "Blimp", "Even while under careful observation, large flocks of Drifblim flying at dusk will inexplicably disappear from view. No one knows where they go.", "Esgotos dos Pelicanos, Covil dos Insetos & Bosque Secreto", "Primavera & Verão", "Noite Nebulosa, Chuva ou Céu Limpo", "Noturno (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Ghost, PokemonType.Flying, 1.2f, 15.0f);
		Add(entries, 427, "Buneary", "Rabbit", "You can tell how it feels by the way it rolls its ears. When it's scared, both ears are rolled up. When it senses danger, it perks them up.", "Montanha, Ponto de Ônibus & Ilha Gengibre", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, null, 0.4f, 5.5f);
		Add(entries, 428, "Lopunny", "Rabbit", "An extremely cautious Pokémon. It is very conscious of its looks and never fails to groom its ears. It runs with sprightly jumps.", "Deserto de Calico, Fazenda & Arredores da Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, null, 1.2f, 33.3f);
		Add(entries, 429, "Mismagius", "Magical", "Its cries sound like incantations. Those hearing it are tormented by headaches and hallucinations. It appears where you least expect it.", "Esgotos dos Pelicanos, Covil dos Insetos & Bosque Secreto", "Todas as Estações (Ano Inteiro)", "Noite Nebulosa, Chuva ou Céu Limpo", "Noturno (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Ghost, null, 0.9f, 4.4f);
		Add(entries, 430, "Honchkrow", "Big Boss", "Becoming active at night, it is known to swarm with numerous Murkrow in tow. It is said that it never forgives the mistakes of its cronies.", "Minas Profundas (80-120), Caverna da Caveira & Cemitério", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Noite Nebulosa, Chuva ou Céu Limpo", "Noturno (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Dark, PokemonType.Flying, 0.9f, 27.3f);
		Add(entries, 431, "Glameow", "Catty", "It is a very fickle Pokémon, which is very popular among some. It claws its Trainer's nose if it isn't fed and purrs when affectionate.", "Deserto de Calico, Fazenda & Arredores da Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, null, 0.5f, 3.9f);
		Add(entries, 432, "Purugly", "Tiger Cat", "It is a brazen brute that barges its way into another Pokémon's nest and claims it as its own. It binds its body with its tails to make itself look bigger.", "Fazenda, Vila Pelicanos & Floresta Cinzenta", "Primavera, Verão & Outono", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, null, 1.0f, 43.8f);
		Add(entries, 433, "Chingling", "Bell", "There is an orb inside its mouth. When it hops, the orb bounces all over and makes a ringing sound. It can cry for an awfully long time.", "Ilha Gengibre (Ruínas Tropicais), Ferrovia & Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Psychic, null, 0.2f, 0.6f);
		Add(entries, 434, "Stunky", "Skunk", "It protects itself by spraying a nose-curling, stinky fluid from its rear to repel attackers. The stench lingers for 24 hours.", "Bosque Secreto Noturno, Esgotos & Pantanal da Bruxa", "Primavera & Verão", "Noite Nebulosa, Chuva ou Céu Limpo", "Noturno (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Poison, PokemonType.Dark, 0.4f, 19.2f);
		Add(entries, 435, "Skuntank", "Skunk", "It attacks by spraying a horribly smelly fluid from the tip of its tail. The fluid smells worse the longer it is allowed to fester.", "Esgotos dos Pelicanos, Covil dos Insetos & Bosque Secreto", "Outono & Inverno", "Noite Nebulosa, Chuva ou Céu Limpo", "Noturno (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Poison, PokemonType.Dark, 1.0f, 38.0f);
		Add(entries, 436, "Bronzor", "Bronze", "Implements shaped like it were discovered in ancient tombs. There are researchers who believe this Pokémon reflected like a mirror in the distant past.", "Minas da Montanha (1-39), Pedreira & Deserto", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Steel, PokemonType.Psychic, 0.5f, 60.5f);
		Add(entries, 437, "Bronzong", "Bronze Bell", "In ages past, this Pokémon was revered as a bringer of rain. One caused a news stir when it was dug up at a construction site after a 2000-year sleep.", "Caverna da Caveira, Deserto de Calico & Vulcão", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Steel, PokemonType.Psychic, 1.3f, 187.0f);
		Add(entries, 438, "Bonsly", "Bonsai", "Bonsly prefers an arid atmosphere. In order to adjust the level of fluids in its body, it exudes water from its eyes. This makes it appear to be crying.", "Deserto de Calico, Pedreira & Caverna da Caveira", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Rock, null, 0.5f, 15.0f);
		Add(entries, 439, "Mime Jr.", "Mime", "In an attempt to confuse its enemy, it mimics the enemy's movements. Once mimicked, the foe cannot take its eyes off this Pokémon.", "Ilha Gengibre (Selva Tropical) & Bosque Secreto", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Psychic, PokemonType.Fairy, 0.6f, 13.0f);
		Add(entries, 440, "Happiny", "Playhouse", "It carries a round white rock in its belly pouch. If it gets along well with someone, it will sometimes give that person the rock.", "Deserto de Calico, Fazenda & Arredores da Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, null, 0.6f, 24.4f);
		Add(entries, 441, "Chatot", "Music Note", "It mimics the cries of other Pokémon to trick them into thinking it's one of them. This way they won't attack it. It can also learn and speak human words.", "Fazenda, Vila Pelicanos & Floresta Cinzenta", "Todas as Estações (Ano Inteiro)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, PokemonType.Flying, 0.5f, 1.9f);
		Add(entries, 442, "Spiritomb", "Forbidden", "A Pokémon that was formed by 108 spirits. Its constant mischief and misdeeds resulted in it being bound to an Odd Keystone by a mysterious spell.", "Minas Profundas (80-120), Caverna da Caveira & Cemitério", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Noite Nebulosa, Chuva ou Céu Limpo", "Noturno (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Ghost, PokemonType.Dark, 1.0f, 108.0f);
		Add(entries, 443, "Gible", "Land Shark", "It nests in horizontal holes warmed by geothermal heat. Foes who stray too close can expect to be pounced on and bitten.", "Caverna da Caveira, Deserto de Calico & Vulcão", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Dragon, PokemonType.Ground, 0.7f, 20.5f);
		Add(entries, 444, "Gabite", "Cave", "Shiny objects are its passion. It can be found in its cave, scarcely moving, its gaze fixed on the jewels it's amassed or Carbink it has caught.", "Deserto de Calico, Pedreira & Caverna da Caveira", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Dragon, PokemonType.Ground, 1.4f, 56.0f);
		Add(entries, 445, "Garchomp", "Mach", "When it folds up its body and extends its wings, it looks like a jet plane. It is covered in fine scales that reduce drag, enabling it to fly at high speeds.", "Minas da Montanha (1-39), Pedreira & Deserto", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Dragon, PokemonType.Ground, 1.9f, 95.0f);
		Add(entries, 446, "Munchlax", "Big Eater", "When it finds something that looks like it might be edible, it goes right ahead and swallows it whole. That's why it gets fatter day by day.", "Deserto de Calico, Fazenda & Arredores da Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, null, 0.6f, 105.0f);
		Add(entries, 447, "Riolu", "Emanation", "It can discern the physical and emotional states of people, Pokémon, and other natural things from the shape of their aura waves.", "Fazenda, Vila Pelicanos & Floresta Cinzenta", "Outono & Inverno", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Fighting, null, 0.7f, 20.2f);
		Add(entries, 448, "Lucario", "Aura", "It understands human speech. It is said that no foe can remain invisible to Lucario, since it can detect Auras. Even foes it could not otherwise see.", "Minas da Montanha (1-39), Pedreira & Deserto", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Fighting, PokemonType.Steel, 1.2f, 54.0f);
		Add(entries, 449, "Hippopotas", "Hippo", "Hippopotas shuts its nostrils tight when travelling through sand. Instead of perspiration, it expels grains of sand from its body.", "Caverna da Caveira, Deserto de Calico & Vulcão", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Ground, null, 0.8f, 49.5f);
		Add(entries, 450, "Hippowdon", "Heavyweight", "It is surprisingly quick to anger. It brandishes its gaping mouth in a display of fearsome strength and raises vast quantities of sand while attacking.", "Deserto de Calico, Pedreira & Caverna da Caveira", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Ground, null, 2.0f, 300.0f);
		Add(entries, 451, "Skorupi", "Scorpion", "It grips prey with its tail claws and injects poison. It tenaciously hangs on until the poison takes. It can survive a year without food.", "Minas Profundas (80-120), Caverna da Caveira & Cemitério", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Poison, PokemonType.Bug, 0.8f, 12.0f);
		Add(entries, 452, "Drapion", "Ogre Scorp", "Possessing a sturdy build, it takes pride in its strength. It has the power in its clawed arms to make scrap out of a car.", "Bosque Secreto Noturno, Esgotos & Pantanal da Bruxa", "Primavera, Verão & Outono", "Noite Nebulosa, Chuva ou Céu Limpo", "Noturno (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Poison, PokemonType.Dark, 1.3f, 61.5f);
		Add(entries, 453, "Croagunk", "Toxic Mouth", "Croagunk rarely fights fairly. Inflating its poison sacs, it fills the area with an odd sound and hits flinching opponents with a poison jab.", "Esgotos dos Pelicanos, Covil dos Insetos & Bosque Secreto", "Todas as Estações (Ano Inteiro)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Poison, PokemonType.Fighting, 0.7f, 23.0f);
		Add(entries, 454, "Toxicroak", "Toxic Mouth", "Swaying and dodging the attacks of its foes, it weaves its flexible body in close, then lunges out with its poisonous claws.", "Minas Profundas (80-120), Caverna da Caveira & Cemitério", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Poison, PokemonType.Fighting, 1.3f, 44.4f);
		Add(entries, 455, "Carnivine", "Bug Catcher", "Hanging from branches using its tentacles, it looks like a plant. It attracts prey with its sweet-smelling saliva, then chomps down.", "Arredores da Vila Pelicanos, Fazenda & Floresta", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Grass, null, 1.4f, 27.0f);
		Add(entries, 456, "Finneon", "Wing Fish", "Its double tail fins propel its energetic jumps. When it breaks the surface of the sea, Wingull swoop down to grab it on the fly.", "Praia dos Pelicanos, Oceano & Ilha Gengibre (Praia Tropical)", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, null, 0.4f, 7.0f);
		Add(entries, 457, "Lumineon", "Neon", "Lumineon swimming in the darkness of the deep sea look like stars shining in the night sky. It competes for food with Lanturn.", "Rios da Floresta Cinzenta, Lago da Montanha & Ilha Tropical", "Todas as Estações (Ano Inteiro)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, null, 1.2f, 24.0f);
		Add(entries, 458, "Mantyke", "Kite", "When it swims close to the surface of the ocean, people aboard ships are able to observe the pattern on its back. It often swims in a school of Remoraid.", "Ilha Gengibre (Costa Sul & Rio Tropical) & Praia", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, PokemonType.Flying, 1.0f, 65.0f);
		Add(entries, 459, "Snover", "Frost Tree", "During cold seasons, it migrates to the mountain's lower reaches. Seemingly curious about people, they gather around footsteps they find on snowy mountains.", "Pico da Montanha, Ferrovia & Floresta no Inverno", "Inverno (Qualquer estação nas Minas 40-79)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Grass, PokemonType.Ice, 1.0f, 50.5f);
		Add(entries, 460, "Abomasnow", "Frost Tree", "It lives a quiet life on mountains that are perpetually covered in snow. It hides itself by whipping up blizzards. It is also known as “The Ice Monster.”", "Minas Congeladas (Andares 40-79) & Montanha no Inverno", "Inverno (Qualquer estação nas Minas 40-79)", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Grass, PokemonType.Ice, 2.2f, 135.5f);
		Add(entries, 461, "Weavile", "Sharp Claw", "They travel in groups of four or five, leaving signs for one another on trees and rocks. They bring down their prey with coordinated attacks.", "Pico da Montanha, Ferrovia & Floresta no Inverno", "Inverno (Qualquer estação nas Minas 40-79)", "Noite Nebulosa, Chuva ou Céu Limpo", "Noturno (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Dark, PokemonType.Ice, 1.1f, 34.0f);
		Add(entries, 462, "Magnezone", "Magnet Area", "As it zooms through the sky, this Pokémon seems to be receiving signals of unknown origin, while transmitting its own signals of unknown purpose.", "Deserto de Calico, Pedreira & Caverna da Caveira", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Tempestade de Raios ou Chuva", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Electric, PokemonType.Steel, 1.2f, 180.0f);
		Add(entries, 463, "Lickilicky", "Licking", "The long tongue is always soggy with slobber. The saliva contains a solvent that causes numbness. Getting too close to it will leave you soaked with drool.", "Montanha, Ponto de Ônibus & Ilha Gengibre", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, null, 1.7f, 140.0f);
		Add(entries, 464, "Rhyperior", "Drill", "It can launch a rock held in its hand like a missile by tightening and then expanding its muscles instantaneously. Geodude are shot at rare times.", "Caverna da Caveira, Deserto de Calico & Vulcão", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Ground, PokemonType.Rock, 2.4f, 282.8f);
		Add(entries, 465, "Tangrowth", "Vine", "It ensnares prey by extending arms made of vines. Even if one of its arms is eaten, it's fine. The Pokémon regenerates quickly and will go right back to normal.", "Floresta Cinzenta, Bosque Secreto & Fazenda", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Grass, null, 2.0f, 128.6f);
		Add(entries, 466, "Electivire", "Thunderbolt", "When it gets excited, it thumps its chest. With every thud, thunder roars, electric sparks shower all around and blue sparks begin to crackle between its horns.", "Montanha, Ferrovia, Torre do Mago & Deserto de Calico", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Tempestade de Raios ou Chuva", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Electric, null, 1.8f, 138.6f);
		Add(entries, 467, "Magmortar", "Blast", "According to what is known, a single pair of male and female Magmortar lives in one volcano. From its arm, it launches fireballs hotter than 3,600ºF.", "Caverna da Caveira & Forja do Vulcão", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Fire, null, 1.6f, 68.0f);
		Add(entries, 468, "Togekiss", "Jubilee", "As everyone knows, it visits peaceful regions, bringing them gifts of kindness and sweet blessings. It will never appear where there is strife.", "Floresta Cinzenta, Bosque Secreto & Fazenda", "Primavera, Verão & Outono", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Fairy, PokemonType.Flying, 1.5f, 38.0f);
		Add(entries, 469, "Yanmega", "Ogre Darner", "This six-legged Pokémon is easily capable of transporting an adult in flight. It is adept at biting apart foes while flying by at high speed.", "Ilha Gengibre (Selva Tropical) & Bosque Secreto", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Bug, PokemonType.Flying, 1.9f, 51.5f);
		Add(entries, 470, "Leafeon", "Verdant", "Its cellular composition is closer to that of a plant than an animal. It uses photosynthesis to produce its energy supply without eating food.", "Arredores da Vila Pelicanos, Fazenda & Floresta", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Grass, null, 1.0f, 25.5f);
		Add(entries, 471, "Glaceon", "Fresh Snow", "It can control its body temperature at will. This enables it to freeze the moisture in the atmosphere, creating flurries of diamond dust.", "Pico da Montanha, Ferrovia & Floresta no Inverno", "Inverno (Qualquer estação nas Minas 40-79)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Ice, null, 0.8f, 25.9f);
		Add(entries, 472, "Gliscor", "Fang Scorp", "Gliscor observes prey while hanging upside down from branches. Its flight is soundless. When the chance presents itself, it swoops!", "Minas da Montanha (1-39), Pedreira & Deserto", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Ground, PokemonType.Flying, 2.0f, 42.5f);
		Add(entries, 473, "Mamoswine", "Twin Tusk", "A frozen Mamoswine was dug from ice dating back 10,000 years. It woke up to much amazement. This Pokémon has been around for a long, long, long time.", "Pico da Montanha, Ferrovia & Floresta no Inverno", "Inverno (Qualquer estação nas Minas 40-79)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Ice, PokemonType.Ground, 2.5f, 291.0f);
		Add(entries, 474, "Porygon-Z", "Virtual", "In order to create a more advanced Pokémon, an additional program was installed, but apparently it contained a defect that made it move oddly.", "Fazenda, Vila Pelicanos & Floresta Cinzenta", "Primavera & Verão", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, null, 0.9f, 34.0f);
		Add(entries, 475, "Gallade", "Blade", "A master of courtesy and swordsmanship, it fights using extending swords on its elbows when trying to protect someone. It can sense what its foe is thinking.", "Ilha Gengibre (Ruínas Tropicais), Ferrovia & Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Psychic, PokemonType.Fighting, 1.6f, 52.0f);
		Add(entries, 476, "Probopass", "Compass", "It freely controls three units called Mini-Noses using magnetic force. With them, it can attack its foes from three directions.", "Caverna da Caveira, Deserto de Calico & Vulcão", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Rock, PokemonType.Steel, 1.4f, 340.0f);
		Add(entries, 477, "Dusknoir", "Gripper", "This feared Pokémon is said to travel to worlds unknown. Some even believe that it takes lost spirits into its pliant body and guides them home.", "Esgotos dos Pelicanos, Covil dos Insetos & Bosque Secreto", "Todas as Estações (Ano Inteiro)", "Noite Nebulosa, Chuva ou Céu Limpo", "Noturno (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Ghost, null, 2.2f, 106.6f);
		Add(entries, 478, "Froslass", "Snow Land", "When it finds people or Pokémon it likes, it freezes them and takes them to its chilly den, where they become its decorations.", "Minas Congeladas (Andares 40-79) & Montanha no Inverno", "Inverno (Qualquer estação nas Minas 40-79)", "Noite Nebulosa, Chuva ou Céu Limpo", "Noturno (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Ice, PokemonType.Ghost, 1.3f, 26.6f);
		Add(entries, 479, "Rotom", "Plasma", "Its body is composed of plasma and loves to surprise others. One boy's invention led to the development of many machines that can use of Rotom's unique capabilities.", "Bosque Secreto Noturno, Esgotos & Pantanal da Bruxa", "Outono & Inverno", "Tempestade de Raios ou Chuva", "Noturno (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Electric, PokemonType.Ghost, 0.3f, 0.3f);
		Add(entries, 480, "Uxie", "Knowledge", "Known as ”The Being of Knowledge,” according to some sources, this Pokémon provided people with the intelligence necessary to solve various problems.", "Bosque Secreto, Santuário da Ilha & Cume do Vale", "Primavera, Verão & Outono", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Crepúsculo & Noite Profunda (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Legendary", PokemonType.Psychic, null, 0.3f, 0.3f);
		Add(entries, 481, "Mesprit", "Emotion", "Although it slumbers at the bottom of a lake, its spirit is said to leave its body and flitter on the water surface. It taught humans of sorrow, pain, and joy.", "Bosque Secreto, Santuário da Ilha & Cume do Vale", "Todas as Estações (Ano Inteiro)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Amanhecer Dourado (06:00h às 10:00h)", "Legendary", PokemonType.Psychic, null, 0.3f, 0.3f);
		Add(entries, 482, "Azelf", "Willpower", "This Pokémon is said to have endowed humans with the determination needed to do things. It is thought that Uxie, Mesprit and Azelf all came from the same egg.", "Bosque Secreto, Santuário da Ilha & Cume do Vale", "Primavera & Verão", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Meia-Noite (22:00h às 02:00h)", "Legendary", PokemonType.Psychic, null, 0.3f, 0.3f);
		Add(entries, 483, "Dialga", "Temporal", "A Pokémon spoken of in legend. It completely controls the flow of time. It uses its power to travel at will through the past and future.", "Vulcão da Ilha Gengibre (Caldeira) & Caverna da Caveira", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Crepúsculo & Noite Profunda (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Legendary", PokemonType.Steel, PokemonType.Dragon, 5.4f, 683.0f);
		Add(entries, 484, "Palkia", "Spatial", "Palkia has the ability to distort space. Its total control over the boundaries of space enable it to transport itself to faraway places and other dimensions.", "Ilha Gengibre (Recife Oeste) & Profundezas Oceânicas", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Amanhecer Dourado (06:00h às 10:00h)", "Legendary", PokemonType.Water, PokemonType.Dragon, 4.2f, 336.0f);
