		Add(entries, 759, "Stufful", "Flailing", "Despite its adorable appearance, when it gets angry and flails about, its arms and legs could knock a pro wrestler sprawling. It's an incredibly dangerous Pokémon.", "Fazenda, Vila Pelicanos & Floresta Cinzenta", "Outono & Inverno", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, PokemonType.Fighting, 0.5f, 6.8f);
		Add(entries, 760, "Bewear", "Strong Arm", "This Pokémon has the habit of hugging its companions. Many Trainers have left this world after their spines were squashed by its hug.", "Montanha, Ponto de Ônibus & Ilha Gengibre", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, PokemonType.Fighting, 2.1f, 135.0f);
		Add(entries, 761, "Bounsweet", "Fruit", "A delectable aroma pours from its body. Bounsweet's sweat can be watered down into a juice with just the right amount of sweetness.", "Arredores da Vila Pelicanos, Fazenda & Floresta", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Grass, null, 0.3f, 3.2f);
		Add(entries, 762, "Steenee", "Fruit", "The sepals on its head developed to protect its body. These are quite hard, so even if pecked by bird Pokémon, this Pokémon is totally fine.", "Floresta Cinzenta, Bosque Secreto & Fazenda", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Grass, null, 0.7f, 8.2f);
		Add(entries, 763, "Tsareena", "Fruit", "Its long, striking legs aren't just for show but to be used to kick with skill. In victory, it shows off by kicking the defeated, laughing boisterously.", "Ilha Gengibre (Selva Tropical) & Bosque Secreto", "Primavera, Verão & Outono (Ano todo na Ilha Tropical)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Diurno (06:00h às 18:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Grass, null, 1.2f, 21.4f);
		Add(entries, 764, "Comfey", "Posy Picker", "It attaches flowers to its nutritious vine. Baths prepared with the flowers from its vine have a relaxing effect, so this Pokémon is a hit with many people.", "Arredores da Vila Pelicanos, Fazenda & Floresta", "Primavera, Verão & Outono", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Fairy, null, 0.1f, 0.3f);
		Add(entries, 765, "Oranguru", "Sage", "Deep in the jungle, high in the lofty canopy, this Pokémon abides. On rare occasions, it shows up at the beach to match wits with Slowking.", "Ilha Gengibre (Ruínas Tropicais), Ferrovia & Vila", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Normal, PokemonType.Psychic, 1.5f, 76.0f);
		Add(entries, 766, "Passimian", "Teamwork", "They battle with hard berries for weapons. They form groups of about 20 individuals. Their techniques are passed from the boss to the group, generation upon generation.", "Montanha, Ponto de Ônibus & Ilha Gengibre", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Fighting, null, 2.0f, 82.8f);
		Add(entries, 767, "Wimpod", "Turn Tail", "This Pokémon is a coward. As it desperately dashes off, the flailing of its many legs leaves a sparkling clean path in its wake. It lives on beaches and seabeds.", "Ilha Gengibre (Costa Sul & Rio Tropical) & Praia", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Bug, PokemonType.Water, 0.5f, 12.0f);
		Add(entries, 768, "Golisopod", "Hard Scale", "It battles skillfully with its six arms, with a flashing slash of its giant sharp claws, it cleaves seawater--or even air--right in two.", "Praia dos Pelicanos, Oceano & Ilha Gengibre (Praia Tropical)", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Bug, PokemonType.Water, 2.0f, 108.0f);
		Add(entries, 769, "Sandygast", "Sand Heap", "It takes control of anyone who puts a hand in its mouth, to add to the pile of its sand-mound body. This Pokémon embodies the grudges of the departed.", "Minas da Montanha (1-39), Pedreira & Deserto", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Noturno (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Ghost, PokemonType.Ground, 0.5f, 70.0f);
		Add(entries, 770, "Palossand", "Sand Castle", "Possessed people controlled by this Pokémon transformed its sand mound into a castle. As it evolved, its power to curse grew ever stronger.", "Caverna da Caveira, Deserto de Calico & Vulcão", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado / Calor Seco", "Noturno (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Ghost, PokemonType.Ground, 1.3f, 250.0f);
		Add(entries, 771, "Pyukumuku", "Sea Cucumber", "It lives in shallow seas, such as areas near a beach. The sticky mucous that covers their bodies can be used to soothe sunburned skin. How convenient!", "Praia dos Pelicanos, Oceano & Ilha Gengibre (Praia Tropical)", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, null, 0.3f, 1.2f);
		Add(entries, 772, "Type: Null", "Synthetic", "Due to the danger that this synthetic Pokémon may go on a rampage, it wears a control mask to restrain its capabilities. It has some hidden special power.", "Cume do Vale (The Summit), Caverna da Caveira & Vulcão", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Amanhecer Dourado (06:00h às 10:00h)", "Legendary", PokemonType.Normal, null, 1.9f, 120.5f);
		Add(entries, 773, "Silvally", "Espécie", "Silvally habita os ecossistemas naturais da região e possui habilidades únicas.", "Cume do Vale (The Summit), Caverna da Caveira & Vulcão", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Ensolarado ou Ventania", "Meia-Noite (22:00h às 02:00h)", "Legendary", PokemonType.Normal, null, 1.0f, 20.0f);
