		Add(entries, 877, "Morpeko", "Two-Sided", "As it eats the seeds stored up in its pocket-like pouches, this Pokémon is not just satisfying its constant hunger. It's also generating electricity.", "Minas Profundas (80-120), Caverna da Caveira & Cemitério", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Tempestade de Raios ou Chuva", "Noturno (18:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Electric, PokemonType.Dark, 0.3f, 3.0f);
		Add(entries, 878, "Cufant", "Copperderm", "It digs up the ground with its trunk. It's also very strong, being able to carry loads of over five tons without any problem at all.", "Caverna da Caveira, Deserto de Calico & Vulcão", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Prefere Sol)", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Steel, null, 1.2f, 100.0f);
		Add(entries, 879, "Copperajah", "Copperderm", "They came over from another region long ago and worked together with humans. Their green skin is resistant to water.", "Deserto de Calico, Pedreira & Caverna da Caveira", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Steel, null, 3.0f, 650.0f);
		Add(entries, 880, "Dracozolt", "Fossil", "In ancient times, it was unbeatable thanks to its powerful lower body, but it went extinct anyway after it depleted all its plant-based food sources.", "Caverna da Caveira, Vulcão da Ilha & Cume da Montanha", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Tempestade de Raios ou Chuva", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Electric, PokemonType.Dragon, 1.8f, 190.0f);
		Add(entries, 881, "Arctozolt", "Fossil", "The shaking of its freezing upper half is what generates its electricity. It has a hard time walking around.", "Pico da Montanha, Ferrovia & Floresta no Inverno", "Inverno (Qualquer estação nas Minas 40-79)", "Tempestade de Raios ou Chuva", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Electric, PokemonType.Ice, 2.3f, 150.0f);
		Add(entries, 882, "Dracovish", "Fossil", "Powerful legs and jaws made it the apex predator of its time. Its own overhunting of its prey was what drove it to extinction.", "Praia dos Pelicanos, Oceano & Ilha Gengibre (Praia Tropical)", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Chuva, Tempestade ou Dias Úmidos", "Dia Inteiro (06:00h às 02:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, PokemonType.Dragon, 2.3f, 215.0f);
		Add(entries, 883, "Arctovish", "Fossil", "Though it's able to capture prey by freezing its surroundings, it has trouble eating the prey afterward because its mouth is on top of its head.", "Pico da Montanha, Ferrovia & Floresta no Inverno", "Inverno (Qualquer estação nas Minas 40-79)", "Chuva Leve ou Céu Limpo", "Manhã & Tarde (06:00h às 19:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Water, PokemonType.Ice, 2.0f, 175.0f);
		Add(entries, 884, "Duraludon", "Alloy", "Its body resembles polished metal, and it's both lightweight and strong. The only drawback is that it rusts easily.", "Caverna da Caveira, Deserto de Calico & Vulcão", "Todas as Estações (Primavera, Verão, Outono, Inverno)", "Qualquer Clima (Sol ou Chuva)", "Tarde & Noite (12:00h às 00:00h)", "Normal", PokemonType.Steel, PokemonType.Dragon, 1.8f, 40.0f);
